{"pair_id": "pair_tgc_4808ad232dc9", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "positive", "filler": "long primary PD excerpt for goetia_catalog (Grant Morrison/CCRU/chaos fresh focus)", "span": "\\\\*\\\\*\\\\* START OF THE PROJECT GUTENBERG EBOOK THE LESSER KEY OF SOLOMON GOETIA THE BOOK OF EVIL SPIRITS \\*\\*\\* !( * * * # The Lesser Key of Solomon **The Lesser Key Of Solomon** **GOETIA** **The Book Of Evil Spirits** **CONTAINS TWO HUNDRED DIAGRAMS AND** **SEALS FOR INVOCATION AND CONVOCATION** **OF SPIRITS NECROMANCY,** **WITCHCRAFT AND** **BLACK ART.** **TRANSLATED FROM ANCIENT MANUSCRIPTS** **IN THE BRITISH MUSEUM, LONDON** **Ceremonial Magic** _Only Authorized Edition Extant_ Published Und", "atom_id": "pd.goetia_catalog.db1b38f3", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
