{"pair_id": "pair_low_8a60efe52873", "family_id": "tantra_hist_pd", "role": "positive", "filler": "long primary PD excerpt for tantra_hist_pd (continue low family boost)", "span": "The tantric texts teach that the body contains subtle channels and centers of energy. By directing the breath and awareness through these channels the practitioner can awaken the kundalini and achieve union with the divine. The practices are to be undertaken under the guidance of a qualified teacher.", "atom_id": "pd.tantra_hist_pd.0e1e0ceb", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
