{"pair_id": "corr.tarot_history.letter.da804a", "family_id": "tarot_history", "role": "letter", "filler": "In this manner, faith being lost in its message, the", "span": "Tarot became a game, while its pictures underwent modification according", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
