{"pair_id": "corr.tarot_history.text.66b10d", "family_id": "tarot_history", "role": "text", "filler": "Thanks to the pagan genius of Virgil, Dante emerges from", "span": "that gulf above the door of which he had read", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
