{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "Let all these be beaten together in a brazen mortar,", "span": "then sifted finely and made into a paste with the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "What a mockery, after all, Democracy is! And how hopelessly", "span": "the modern world is deluded in thinking that anywhere or", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "To follow the writings of Paracelsus it is necessary to", "span": "understand his phraseology, his jargon, as we should call it", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "Many of these expressions have been adopted by the Theosophists", "span": "of the present day and by students of Occultism. It", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Not only was Paracelsus a pioneer in Hom\u0153opathy and animal", "span": "magnetism, he was also one of the first, as well", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "This was none other than the notorious Cardinal de Rohan.", "span": "It is hardly necessary to state that the ecclesiastical dignitary", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "If not, he has no need of me nor I", "span": "of him.\u201d In spite of the Count\u2019s stand-offishness, the Cardinal", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "The unscrupulous De Morande, as we have already seen, was", "span": "paid by the Court to ruin his reputation and to", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "Even Newton seems to have hankered after it when young.", "span": "Among his MSS. in Lord Portsmouth\u2019s library at Hurstbourne are", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "Conceive the respected head of your College\u2014or whoever he may", "span": "be\u2014in case you slept out all night without leave, going", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "And fact seemed to be on his side. He reappeared", "span": "in Germany about 1525, and began working wondrous cures. He", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "They shuddered under their red gowns and hats. If science", "span": "was to be taught in German, farewell to the Galenists\u2019", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "He was a \u201cdull rustic, a monster, an atheist, a", "span": "quack, a maker of gold, a magician.\u201d When he was", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "Mars, he says, did not make Nero cruel. There would", "span": "have been long-lived men in the world if Saturn had", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "But the charm of Paracelsus is in his humour, his", "span": "mother-wit. He was blamed for consorting with boors in pot-houses;", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "Mystics of the Renaissance | Project Gutenberg *** START OF", "span": "THE PROJECT GUTENBERG EBOOK 75994 *** i MYSTICS OF THE", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "Confidence, trust in the world must be one of our", "span": "guides upon this third path; courage, to follow that confidence", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "Nevertheless, I am vividly conscious that in our learned scientific", "span": "works and treatises there is to be found many a", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "He calls Nature, in so far as it is looked", "span": "at on this level, \u201celementary Nature.\u201d On the second stage,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "After me; not I after you, Avicenna, Rhases, Galen, Mesur!", "span": "After me; not I after you, O ye of Paris,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "From out of its depths the riddle of humanity takes", "span": "shape for him. Let us watch how this happens in", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "It is one member, one link in that whole, having", "span": "its very existence only in relation with all the other", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "The fact that Paracelsus reckons as truths in this domain", "span": "things which we doubt to-day, does not come into the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "Then arises the knowledge of which Eckhart spoke when he", "span": "felt no longer that he was speaking within himself, but", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "Must one then first ascribe to the plant a soul", "span": "after the kind of a human soul, in order to", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "To Nature is even assigned the task of explaining her", "span": "own creations; and the Spirit can plunge into itself there,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "\u201cFor nature brings nothing to light, which as such is", "span": "perfect, but man must make it perfect.\u201d This self-creative activity", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "Different 220 things are called by the same names at", "span": "different times. What the ancients called the four elements: Earth,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "That which through their 222 sensible reality they have to", "span": "unveil from within the soul of man, stands, for him", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "Jacob Boehme describes his own state as Piety which strives", "span": "only to be Wisdom, and as a Wisdom that seeks", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "In dark astringency the Root-Being receives form, dumbly shut up", "span": "within itself and motionless. This astringency Boehme grasps under the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "(2) It is that which God created when He uttered", "span": "the Fiat Lux . (3) It is the great medium", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "It is not as such, one would say, a thaumaturgic", "span": "process, unless indeed the dream should rule\u2014as it tends to", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "Those who know anything of Egypt\u2014the antiquities of its religion", "span": "and literature\u2014will have a bad experience with the chapter on", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
