{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "Pliny relates these facts on the authority of an ancient", "span": "Etruscan tradition and mentions that Numa directed his battery with", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "Now, exchange is impossible when everything belongs to a few", "span": "and nothing to others. What do social gradations signify in", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "\u201cThe sun is its father and the moon its mother;", "span": "the wind has borne it in the belly thereof.\u201d It", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "Such answers result from the varied combination of the different", "span": "signs. But it requires a considerable exercise of reason to", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "But we must first finish with the Gentiles and follow", "span": "through pagan civilisation the story of materialised hieroglyphics and of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "It was only the history of ideas which was written", "span": "by the great of those days, and they were at", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "The Argonautic vessel, built of timber from the prophetic oaks", "span": "of Dodona, the speaking vessel, is the ship of the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "A fermentation follows, comparable to a great battle; the impure", "span": "is devoured by the impure, and the splendid Fleece is", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "Considered as a hieroglyphical sign it represents the circulation of", "span": "the perpetual movement and the relation of the radius to", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "[80] [Pg 111] Prometheus, says the classical fable, having stolen", "span": "fire from heaven, gave life thereby to images formed of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "[Pg 133] CHAPTER III INITIATIONS AND ORDEALS That which adepts", "span": "have distinguished as the Great Work is not only the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "It is at once a philosophical and magical monument, a", "span": "perfect moral synthesis, and moreover the most audacious demonstration ever", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "The Pyramids were the Pantacle of Hermes or of Mercury.", "span": "The Olympian Jupiter was the Pantacle of that god. The", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "His disciples were alarmed at the prodigy, but the master", "span": "gave her his hand, for he knew her. He told", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "Joan of Arc and Jeanne Hachette of Beauvais only carried", "span": "on the traditions of these noble daughters of the Gauls.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "(3) The existence of a secret tradition, reserving the knowledge", "span": "of these mysteries for the sovereign priesthood and the temporal", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "[172] The second pantacle is a head, having three faces,", "span": "crowned by a tiara and issuing from a vessel filled", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "Thomas Aquinas, infuriated at being unable to silence the image,", "span": "broke it with a blow of his stick. Such is", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "St. Thomas changed all that he touched into gold, but", "span": "this is a figure of speech only, gold being in", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "In this sense we are told by Aristeus that air", "span": "must be derived from air; by Khunrath that living mercury", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Ruined by imbecile prodigality, the marshal desired at any cost", "span": "to create wealth. Alchemy had exhausted his last resources and", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "Madame de Raiz took advantage of this indulgence, after which", "span": "Gilles de Laval mounted his horse and departed. To her", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "The third flight led to a dark chamber, where the", "span": "heavy and fetid atmosphere compelled the young women to retreat.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "What more would you have? Surely I have admitted enough", "span": "to condemn ten thousand men.\u201d That which Gilles de Laval", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "The Deniers are the constellations, fixed and movable stars. The", "span": "Swords are fires, flames, rays; the Wands are shadows, stones,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "Ambrosia answered: \u201cTo respond adequately to a love which you", "span": "term supernatural would require an immortal existence. If this love", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "[Pg 322] \u201cIt is I,\u201d she said at length. \u201cWhat", "span": "would you with me?\u201d At the accents of that voice,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Spare me this death which you term life. Let me", "span": "suffer the change which is necessary before I can live", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "They changed their course and, approaching the shore, discovered a", "span": "mound of stones, which diffused far and near this miraculous", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "He perfected and described carefully various compounds which are used", "span": "widely in chemistry; we owe him the preparation of carbonate", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "He also composed a Key to the Testament mentioned, and", "span": "finally a Key to the Key or, more definitely, a", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "[Pg 331] CHAPTER IV ON CERTAIN ALCHEMISTS Nicholas Flamel belongs", "span": "to alchemy exclusively, and he enters only into our consideration", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "They are seen devouring one another, and the figure as", "span": "a whole is analogous to the Victor of the Tarot,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "On the fourth leaf was the figure of Time, preparing", "span": "to cut off the feet of Mercury. Close by was", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "The children\u2019s blood represents that essential light which is extracted", "span": "by philosophical fire from elementary bodies. When it is said", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "The works of Postel will be rediscovered one of these", "span": "days and will be read with wonder. THE SEVEN PLANETS", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "These globules are actual seeds, ready to assume all forms", "span": "of that world whereof the human body is an abridgment.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "Then he treated the wax with vitriol, iron and fire,", "span": "thus reacting by imagination and magnetic correspondence on the sick", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "To our mind it was a case of fascination by", "span": "the magnetism of the radiant light of blood, a phenomenon", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "He may be called the divine Paracelsus, understood in the", "span": "sense of diviner; he is an oracle, but not a", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "The division of the work is sevenfold, and through these", "span": "sections are distributed the seven degrees of initiation into transcendental", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
