{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "He proceeds to establish the duty of the adept not", "span": "to devote more than the tenth part of his wealth", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "Paracelsus had divined them, Crollius indicates them, another who shall", "span": "follow will realise and provide the demonstration concerning them. What", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
