{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "The repast should begin with a large glass of dew", "span": "and end with a biscuit or crust of bread. There", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "Some hours after the gaoler entered the cell and found", "span": "the body of a strangled man clothed in the garments", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "There are three things in the universe\u2014the Spirit, the plastic", "span": "mediator and matter. The ancients assigned to spirit, as its", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
