{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "Yet he did not fail to understand that the nuptial", "span": "life is also a life of chastity; he speaks eloquently", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
