{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "The transcendental theory of alchemy which they expound is steadily", "span": "gaining favour, though the two text-books which at present represent", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
