{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "[Pg 13] As this interpretation is concerned chiefly with the", "span": "conscience, I have called it the moral theory of alchemy;", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "He does not attempt to make its practical treatment plain", "span": "to the end of [Pg 14] the sublime operation. It", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "Man, therefore, is the true laboratory of the Hermetic art;", "span": "his life is the subject, the grand distillery, the thing", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "The true methods and conditions of self-knowledge are to be", "span": "learned from the ancient writers. The discovery of the veritable", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "It is the Midnight Sun of Apuleius, the Ignited Stone", "span": "of Anaxagoras, the Triumphal Chariot of Antimony, the Armed Magnet", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "The other part of contemplation which is possible is called", "span": "theory. This contemplates that which is perceived by touch and", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "And this is the second foundation of philosophy which follows", "span": "prayer; for in that the sum of the matter lies,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "A studious Tyro of a quick wit, constant mind, inflamed", "span": "with the love of philosophy, very quick in natural philosophy,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "None of the passages in question are inconsistent with the", "span": "physical object of alchemy, and in the citation from Alipili,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "\u201cNo modern art or chemistry has anything to do with", "span": "alchemy, beyond the borrowed terms which were made use of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "Many of them no doubt died over their furnaces, \u2018", "span": "uttering no voice ,\u2019 and none of them wrote books", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "There is no need for argument; the facts speak sufficiently.", "span": "It is not to the blind followers of the alchemists", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "It is impossible, therefore, to contest that the alchemists were", "span": "the first to inaugurate the art of experience. They prepared", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "It is actual gold and nothing else. What does not", "span": "equal a metal in weight will never enter it in", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Such interpretations can never be wholly exonerated from the charge", "span": "of extravagance, and of a purblind indifference to the most", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "It is in this way that a thousand unassisted investigators", "span": "have operated upon ten thousand material substances, and have never", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "Eugenius Philalethes enlarges on the infinite capacity of our spiritual", "span": "nature and on the power of our soul\u2019s imagination. \u201cShe", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "And seeing all created things are inclined to multiplication, the", "span": "philosophers propounded to themselves that they would [Pg 32] make", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "The admirable lesson which we may learn of the alchemists", "span": "is the exaltation of things in virtue beyond the unassisted", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "I am of opinion, from the evidence in hand, that", "span": "metallic transmutations did occur in the past. They were phenomena", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "Only the theory is of value to neophytes, or initiates,", "span": "or to any student of the higher occultism; and it", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "They were often extravagant in their views, they were generally", "span": "absurd in their methods; they seldom found their end, but,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "In all cases, we shall do well to reflect that", "span": "the object in view was metals, except in such rare", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "Those of my readers who are interested in this absorbing", "span": "subject I must refer to a work entitled, \u201c Azoth,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "In the metallic kingdom, the object of nature is invariably", "span": "to create gold. The production of the baser metals is", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "\u201cAs those that sail between Scylla and Charybdis are in", "span": "danger on both sides,\u201d says D\u2019Espagnet, \u201cunto no less hazard", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "So also Philalethes cries in his inspired way:\u2014\u201cHear me, and", "span": "I shall disclose the secret, which like a rose has", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "Given the matter of the stone and also the necessary", "span": "vessel, the processes which must be then undertaken to accomplish", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "The base metals made use of must be purified to", "span": "insure the success of the operation. The process for the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "[E] Commentary on the \u201cAncient War of the Knights.\u201d [Pg", "span": "44] LIVES OF THE ALCHEMISTS. GEBER. The first, and, according", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "They are supposed to have embraced [Pg 45] the whole", "span": "circle of the physical sciences, including astronomy and medicine. A", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "The most complete edition of Geber is that of Dantzich,", "span": "published in 1682, and reproduced in the Collection of Mangetus.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "He was an avowed believer in the transmutation of metals,", "span": "and, having composed a treatise on the subject, he presented", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "It is to him, nevertheless, that we owe the preparation", "span": "of brandy and several pharmaceutic applications of alcohol. He was", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "He despised the world, and took no pains to acquire", "span": "wealth, though he wrote upon alchemy, that is, if the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "He is praised in particular for having discovered that the", "span": "illness of the King of Gordia\u2019s nephew was occasioned by", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "In 1572 the Ars Chimica was printed at Berne. Two", "span": "Hermetic tracts are also attributed to Avicenna by the compilers", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "He describes several varieties of saltpetre, and treats of the", "span": "properties of common salt, vitriol, sulphur, orpiment, sal ammoniac, &c.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "He purchased a retreat near the city of Jerusalem, where", "span": "he settled in the company of a pupil, whom he", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "The work in due course was brought to its absolute", "span": "perfection; the philosopher inscribed these words on the vase in", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "\u201cNo more! I do not wish you to die like", "span": "those impostors who have vaunted themselves to my master.\u201d [Pg", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "Morien, however, was intent only on the conversion of Kalid;", "span": "he made known to him the mysteries of Christianity, but", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "The Liber de Compositione Alchemi\u00e6 contains a Hermetic conversation between", "span": "Morien, Kalid, and Galip. It appeals to the authority of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "So early, however, as the year 1480 the Great Chronicle", "span": "of Belgium records him magnus in magia, major in philosophia,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "In his old age he relapsed into the mediocrity of", "span": "his earlier years, which gave rise to the saying that", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "In the treatise which he wrote upon minerals, Albert informs", "span": "us that he personally tested some gold and silver which", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "THOMAS AQUINAS. If Albertus Magnus must be considered an adept", "span": "in possession of the philosophic stone, there is little doubt", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "These contradictions scarcely afford convincing proof of a common authorship;", "span": "but spurious or otherwise, the works on the Hermetic science", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "Having undertaken to demonstrate that by the help of natural", "span": "science it is possible to actually perform the pretended prodigies", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "He was supposed to be indebted for his [Pg 65]", "span": "wisdom to incessant communication with demons. Wierus accuses him of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "On the word of a man who enjoyed his full", "span": "confidence, he tells us how a celebrated Parisian savant, after", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "He also called attention to the chemical r\u00f4le played by", "span": "the air in combustion. [J] Many of Bacon\u2019s works still", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "The name of Raymond Lully has indeed passed so completely", "span": "into oblivion that it awakes no recollections whatever except in", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "A bridle was put into his mouth, as if he", "span": "were a horse, and he was deprived by this means", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "On this [Pg 83] important point, the writer, already quoted,", "span": "in the Biblioth\u00e8que Universelle , testifies that \u201cthe works on", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "This ecclesiastic is said to have been one of the", "span": "most celebrated Hermetic artists of his age. He worked thirty", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Notwithstanding its inappropriateness, however, the name of royal was given", "span": "to these 10s. pieces, not only by the people, but", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "With regard to \u201cthe Jewish neophyte,\u201d referred to by the", "span": "Biographie Universelle , no particulars of his life are forthcoming.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "He could form aqua regia by [Pg 88] adding sal", "span": "ammoniac, or common salt, to nitric acid, and he was", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "The merchants resolved to say nothing of their precious burden,", "span": "which they embalmed and preserved religiously, being determined to transport", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "Arnold studied medicine at Paris for twenty years, after which", "span": "for ten more he perambulated Italy, visiting the different universities.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "He wrote strictures on the monastic state and the service", "span": "of religion, and maintained that works of divine faith and", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "J. Mangetus. Arnold asserts that argent vive is the medicine", "span": "of all the metals, that vulgar sulphur is the cause", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "It professes, at any rate, the principles of Hermetic Philosophy,", "span": "and Jean de Meung was also the author of \u201cNature\u2019s", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "The indignation of the fathers was excited by the posthumous", "span": "imposture, and they proposed to eject the body of Jean", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "The plant which lay buried in its ashes awakes, uprises,", "span": "and unfolds. In the space of half-an-hour the vegetable ph\u0153nix", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "That he believed in the power of magic is shown", "span": "by the accusation which he directed against G\u00e9raud, Bishop of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "The circumstances of his life are exceedingly obscure until his", "span": "consecration as Bishop of Fr\u00e9jus in 1300. Subsequently he was", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "\u201cWhilst in all ages and nations the majority of hierophants", "span": "have derived little but deception, ruination, and despair as the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "An inscription in characters of gold contained a dedication addressed", "span": "to the Jewish nation by Abraham the Jew, prince, priest,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Without doubt, this was a very pious, wise, and understanding", "span": "man. \u201cIn the third leaf, and in all the writings", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "\u201cThis seemed in my mean apprehension to be one of", "span": "the heathen gods, namely, Mercury. Against him there came running", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "\u201cThis, without doubt, was argent vive , which they could", "span": "not fix; that is, cut off his feet, or take", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "For through the grace of God it was that I", "span": "attained the perfect knowledge of all I desired. \u201cWell, I", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "\u201cAgain, following exactly the directions in my book, literally and", "span": "word by word, I made projection of the red stone,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "[Pg 110] After the death of Perrenelle the bereaved adept", "span": "is supposed to have prepared for posterity several works on", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "It fills four sheets of parchment, which are sewed one", "span": "to the end of the other, like the rolls of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "It was published in the year 1561 by Jacques Goharry.", "span": "Le Grand Eclaircissement first saw the light in 1628, when", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "Other critics, including Louis Figuier, admit the fact of his", "span": "riches, but enlarge upon the remunerative nature of a scrivener\u2019s", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "The divine gift which was so fortunate a possession to", "span": "Flamel is supposed to have been a curse to his", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "This is the true history, and not that which is", "span": "believed at Paris, where there are very few who ever", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "[Pg 119] He wrote and published a complete treatise on", "span": "the art under the title Margarita Pretiosa . Lacinius, a", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "He is represented flourishing in the twelfth, thirteenth, fourteenth, and", "span": "fifteenth centuries; it is even added, without the smallest proof", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "Numerous works have been printed in his name, and the", "span": "authenticity of several is questionable. He wrote in high Dutch,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Many are called, but few chosen to this supreme knowledge.", "span": "The study of the works of the philosophers and practical", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "They were the first alchemists of Holland, and their operations", "span": "were highly esteemed by Paracelsus, Boyle, and Kunckel. In practical", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "The Opera Mineralia Joannis Isaaci Hollandi, sive de Lapide Philosophico", "span": "is a long and elaborate treatise on the [Pg 124]", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "He had laboured in vain to congeal, dissolve, and sublime", "span": "common salt, sal ammoniac, every variety of alum, and copperas.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "Bernard Tr\u00e9visan was now forty-six years old, and at the", "span": "end of his experimental resources he determined to travel in", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "He immediately set out for Germany, accompanied by some baffled", "span": "sons of Hermes like himself. They contrived, par grands moyens", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "In every country he found there were alchemists at work,", "span": "but of those who were successful he could hear no", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "He informs us that it was two years before he", "span": "put his discovery to the test; it was crowned with", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "He was alive at Valenciennes in the year 1413. His", "span": "Hermetic poem, Aux Amoureux de Science , has been printed", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "He felt confident of success in the practice, but the", "span": "adept, on account of his youth, refused to instruct him", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "According to Fuller, he lived and died very poor; nevertheless", "span": "his family appears to have been held in high repute", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "Since that event he had been in so much danger", "span": "and disquietude on account of its possession that he had", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "His father, Sir John Debois, was slain at the battle", "span": "of Tewksbury, May 4, 1471, and two days after, as", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "The \u201cTwelve Gates of Alchemy\u201d he composed in 1471, and", "span": "he declares that any of his experiments recorded from 1450", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "One of my friends, who is still living, has made", "span": "gold and silver over sixty times in my presence. I", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "He is said to have been emasculated in his infancy,", "span": "a tradition which may have been invented to account for", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "In Muscovy he is said to have been taken prisoner", "span": "by the Tartars, who brought him before \u201cthe great Cham.\u201d", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "He began by uncovering a dish which contained excrement. The", "span": "doctors, indignant at the insult, departed precipitately, Paracelsus shouting after", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "In that place, Paracelsus obtained at last the fruits of", "span": "his long labours and of a wide-spread fame. But he", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "It appears that the true name of this persevering and", "span": "indefatigable seeker after the end and truth of alchemy has", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "\u201cBefore the end of the year,\u201d as he himself informs", "span": "us, \u201cmy two hundred crowns were gone in smoke, and", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "I did not lose sight of my work, and became", "span": "acquainted with an old man who was called the philosopher,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "\u201cThe year 1537 passed over without any change appearing in", "span": "the subject of our labours. We might have remained through", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "A variety of systems were held by others, and scarcely", "span": "a day passed in which some of them did not", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "\u201cI felt the truth of this safe counsel, but before", "span": "I put it in execution, I went to see my", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "I then formed my plan , and only waited to", "span": "sell the remainder of my land to enable me to", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "I thanked God for the favour he shewed me, and", "span": "prayed that I should be permitted to use it but", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "The life of Bernard Tr\u00e9visan has abundantly testified to the", "span": "physical nature of his object, which is amply [Pg 148]", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Thomas Charnock was born in the Isle of Thanet, in", "span": "the year 1524. He calls himself an unlettered scholar, and", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "He promised Charnock that if he made a vow not", "span": "to reveal the secret for gold, preferment, or through affection", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "He sent for Charnock, made him the heir of his", "span": "work, and died after giving him instructions how to proceed.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "Furious with disappointment, he took a hatchet, smashed his glasses,", "span": "furnace, and apparatus, and threw them out of the house.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "They were also published separately under the title De Alchimia", "span": "dialogi duo , Lugd., 1548, 4to . The Wood of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "FOOTNOTES: [W] Dictionnaire des Sciences Occultes , i. p. 232.", "span": "[Pg 153] LEONARDI FIORAVANTI. Doctor, surgeon, and alchemist of the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "During this sojourn an old manuscript was shown him by", "span": "[Pg 154] the innkeeper, which was indecipherable by himself or", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "When Edward Kelly, with an assumed antiquarian indifference about objects", "span": "which were more curious than valuable, offered a pound sterling", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "The last abbot was hanged by Henry VIII. for his", "span": "adherence to the Papal cause. Kelly appears to have taken", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "The most authenticated and remarkable, according to Figuier, is that", "span": "which took place in the house of the imperial physician,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "The Book of St Dunstan indicated the use but not", "span": "the preparation of the powder, and their experiments, vigilantly overwatched", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "In 1607 we again find him at Mortlake, living on", "span": "the revenue which he derived from Manchester, but subject to", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "The self same sonne troys yet more, ye must wounde,", "span": "Still with new knives, of the same kinde, and grounde;", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "The second was an Echo Colloquii , by Benedict Hilarion,", "span": "writing in the name of the Rosicrucian Fraternity. It appears", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Jacob B\u00f6hme, who may perhaps be considered as the central", "span": "figure of Christian mysticism, was born in the year 1575,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "He was forbidden to write any more books, and was", "span": "commanded to stick to his trade. For five years he", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "A treatise on metallurgy is ascribed to the theosophist [Pg", "span": "165] himself, and there are several alchemical references in his", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "This author, so illustrious throughout Europe for his scientific knowledge,", "span": "and no less celebrated for his noble rank than by", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "On these grounds he believed in the certainty and in", "span": "the prodigious resources of the art, citing his acquaintance with", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "He was therefore liberated from the prison in which he", "span": "had been confined during the investigation. Butler was afterwards entombed", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "D\u2019Espagnet is also the author of the preface to the", "span": "Tableau de l\u2019Inconstance des D\u00e9mons , by Pierre Delancre. \u201cThe", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "He was a native of Scotland, and is supposed to", "span": "have inhabited a mansion at a village in the vicinity", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "To this adversary we are indebted for a description of", "span": "Sethon, whom he declared eminently spiritual in appearance, short in", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "[AD] Leaving Cologne altogether petrified by his marvellous operations, the", "span": "illustrious hierophant of the art Hermetic betook himself to Hamburg,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "He imprisoned him in a tower, which was guarded by", "span": "forty soldiers, who had strict orders to keep a constant", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "Cologne, 1604. [AE] Galdenfalk, \u201cAlchemical Anecdotes.\u201d MICHAEL SENDIVOGIUS. Sendivogius, whose", "span": "true name was Sensophax, was born at Moravia in 1566,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "Foiled in this attempt, he was still anxious at any", "span": "rate to appear as an adept, and acquired an immense", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "From the Court of Rodolph II. the alchemist proceeded to", "span": "that of Poland. As he passed on his way through", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Sendivogius, once more vividly reminded of the fate of his", "span": "master, precipitately fled, only to be pursued by his treacherous", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "[AF] The elixir relieved the same king from the effects", "span": "of a serious accident. When every particle of his powder", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "They presented him with a letter bearing twelve seals, and", "span": "addressed to Sendivogius. He declared that he was not the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "On the contrary, he which, in a philosophical way, can,", "span": "without any fraud and colourable deceit, make it that it", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "There was no appearance of soldering, or of the possibility", "span": "of deception. [AG] See Vie de Sendivogius, tir\u00e9e de la", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "Upon this information, Richtausen adroitly got possession of the powder,", "span": "and then departed. The nobleman, hearing of the transaction, threatened", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "Athanasius Kircher, the illustrious German Jesuit, records, in his Mundus", "span": "Subterraneus , that one of his friends, whose veracity he", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "I became almost stupid, and, as another Cr\u0153sus, fancied I", "span": "possessed all the riches in the universe. My gratitude to", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "It was published in duodecimo at Paris in 1664, and", "span": "has since been reprinted. In the dedicatory epistle the authorship", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "Second, the fact that almost every edition and translation of", "span": "this treatise contains the following passage in the initial paragraph", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "[Pg 190] If much be confusion which concerns Thomas Vaughan,", "span": "all is chaos in respect of Eiren\u00e6us Philalethes. He would", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "Whoever encounters the eminent peril of his life will act", "span": "with more caution thenceforward. I found the world in a", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "I do not remember that ever I learned anything from", "span": "Raymond Lully. Some who are not adepts give more instruction", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "These also fell into the hands of one who, I", "span": "conceive, will never restore them.\u201d The delinquent in question was", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "I essayed the medicine on copper, iron, even on brass", "span": "and pewter, on spelter, solder, tinglass, mercury, and on regulus", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "He is scarcely thirty-three years of age, and is rarely", "span": "learned. You cannot [Pg 197] know more of him from", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "\u201cWhen I found that my vain attempts only threw away", "span": "the tincture, I stopped my hand, resolving to keep the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "While you were ignorant, I gave you a great gift,", "span": "so that, if Heaven ordained, the gift should destroy itself.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "And seeing you know the art of preparing the fiery", "span": "mercury , you might have as much store as any", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "Those who are in search of the physical secret should", "span": "begin by the careful study of his works; thence they", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "His most curious work is Alchimista Christianus . Toulouse, 1632,", "span": "8vo . In Hercules Piochymicus , published at the same", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "He asked me if I still thought there was no", "span": "medicine in Nature which could cure all diseases, unless the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "\u201cI was in great admiration, and desired to know where", "span": "and how he obtained them. He answered, \u2018A foreigner, who", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "It proved most excellent pure gold, which the stranger said", "span": "brought him into such trembling amazement that he could hardly", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "\u2018Not so, not so,\u2019 said he, \u2018for we ought to", "span": "divulge all things to the children of art which may", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "Amongst the rest, the general Assay-master, examiner of coins of", "span": "this province of Holland, Mr Porelius, who with others earnestly", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "Finally, with a contradiction more French than Italian, he gave", "span": "out that he was himself the Holy Spirit incarnate. Needless", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "Five years passed away, and Frederick III. having died, his", "span": "successor determined on a closer investigation of the transmutatory secrets", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "The account of his voyage to the land of the", "span": "Rosicrucians is a mangled version of Bacon\u2019s \u201cAtlantis;\u201d his apologues,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "His mission in the West was the solicitation of alms", "span": "for the [Pg 212] ransom of Christian prisoners in the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "The experiment was repeated with mercury for the benefit of", "span": "a friend of B\u00f6tticher, the tale spread, and the apothecary\u2019s", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "Their man\u0153uvres resulted in the imprisonment of Pasch at the", "span": "fortress of Sonneinstein, while B\u00f6tticher was closely confined in another", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "In the meantime, Lascaris himself was not idle. On the", "span": "16th February 1609 he is believed to have changed mercury", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "In a word, every anonymous adept who appeared at this", "span": "period in or about Germany is supposed to be Lascaris.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "In Lenglet\u2019s \u201cHistory of Hermetic Philosophy,\u201d there is a letter", "span": "from the Bishop of Senez to the Minister of State", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Afterwards three ounces of pistol bullets were melted and purified", "span": "with alum and saltpetre. Delisle handed Saint-Maurice a small paper,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "His illegitimate son, Alnys, by some means inherited a portion", "span": "of the powder from his mother. He wandered through Italy", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "This Altotas, or Althotes, we are assured by Figuier, was", "span": "no imaginary character. The Roman Inquisition collected many proofs of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "The sale of a certain wash for beautifying the complexion", "span": "appears to have procured him a considerable revenue about this", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "Monsieur Saint-F\u00e9lix, however, declares, and this, on the whole, is", "span": "most probable, that they were received with the most marked", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "According to the M\u00e9moires Authentiques pour servir \u00e0 l\u2019Histoire du", "span": "Comte de Cagliostro , published in 1785, he demanded an", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "Whence come you? What would you?\u201d Then the Count and", "span": "Countess Cagliostro prostrated themselves, and the former answered after a", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "When he took possession of my soul he caused me", "span": "to perceive all objects in a new light; I began", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "Like the rest of the townsfolk he had come out", "span": "to behold the phenomenal personage [Pg 253] whose arrival was", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.1a8e33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "The \u00e9lite of Strasburg society was invited to a sumptuous", "span": "repast, which was followed by a s\u00e9ance of transcendental magnetism,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.0ab2aa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "After a judicious period he admitted that he possessed a", "span": "receipt for the manufacture of gold and diamonds. A supposed", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.6e1f17", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "He informed his daughters that the much abused magical art", "span": "was the secret of doing good to humanity. It was", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.d15bbb", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "As stated in the Introduction to this work, I have", "span": "little personal doubt, after a careful and unbiassed appreciation of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.4a4b1c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "I have brought a wide acquaintance with the history of", "span": "modern supernaturalism to bear [Pg 275] on the serious study", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.716849", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "There are reasons to believe that the grandees who were", "span": "deemed worthy of admission paid exceedingly extravagantly for the honour.\u201d\u2014Figuier,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.f7eaf2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "Johannes Agricola\u2014Of Antimony. ( German. ) 4to . Leipsic, 1639.", "span": "Luigi Alamanni\u2014Girone il Cortese, Poema. 4to . In Parigi, 1548.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
