{"pair_id": "corr.runes_eddic.element.c49a35", "family_id": "runes_eddic", "role": "element", "filler": "It is a reasonable guess that the years between 850", "span": "and 1050 saw the majority of the Eddic poems worked", "atom_id": "a9c8c843a92a", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
