{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.symbol.e9c15c", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "symbol", "filler": "nd causing Worms to breed in them. He governeth 29", "span": "Legions of Spirits, and his Seal is this, etc. Cities,", "atom_id": "pd.goetia_catalog.df356f6b", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
