{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.element.792597", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "element", "filler": "Ex Deo Nascimur. In Jesu Morimur. Per S.S. Reviviscimus. Given", "span": "forth from our Mountain of A., this day of C.C.", "atom_id": "goetia_2", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.symbol.62fc0f", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Hear me: \u2014 Roubria\u014d: Mari\u014ddam: Balbnabaoth: Assalonai: Aphnia\u014d: I: Thoteth:", "span": "Abrasar: A\u00eb\u00f6\u014d\u00fc: Ischure, Mighty and Bornless One! Hear me: etc.", "atom_id": "goetia_3", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.concept.5ce3de", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "concept", "filler": "But can any of the effects described in this our", "span": "book Goetia be obtained, and if so, can you give", "atom_id": "goetia_6", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.text.3f4ddd", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "text", "filler": "Unfortunately, we cannot stop there. Solomon promises us that we", "span": "can (1) obtain information; (2) destroy our enemies; (3) understand", "atom_id": "goetia_7", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.letter.ffed7f", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "letter", "filler": "Origen saith that the Magical Art doth not contain anything", "span": "subsisting, but although it should, yet that it must not", "atom_id": "goetia_8", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.practice.3933c8", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "practice", "filler": "For in the whole work the differences in the wording", "span": "of the various Codices are not sufficient to require the", "atom_id": "goetia_9", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.planet.61ae08", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "planet", "filler": "The which is called Ars Nova , which was revealed", "span": "unto Solomon by that Holy Angel of God called Michael", "atom_id": "goetia_10", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.element.8c11ba", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "element", "filler": "(4) The Fourth Book , called Ars Almadel Salomonis ,", "span": "or The Art Almadel of Solomon , concerneth those Spirits", "atom_id": "goetia_11", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.symbol.78f99a", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "symbol", "filler": "(2) The Second Part is a Book of Spirits, partly", "span": "Evil and partly Good, which is called Theurgia-Goetia , all", "atom_id": "goetia_12", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.concept.6b4e36", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "concept", "filler": "(1) The First Part is a Book of Evil Spirits,", "span": "called Goetia , showing how he bound up those Spirits", "atom_id": "goetia_13", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.text.ade759", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "text", "filler": "\u2014The First Principal Spirit is a King ruling in the", "span": "East, called Bael. He maketh thee to go Invisible. He", "atom_id": "goetia_14", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.letter.c5329d", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "letter", "filler": "He appeareth in the form of a little Horse or", "span": "Ass, and then into Human shape doth he change himself", "atom_id": "goetia_15", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.practice.debf8e", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "practice", "filler": "He telleth all things Past and to Come. He procureth", "span": "feuds and reconcileth controversies between friends. He governeth 40 Legions", "atom_id": "goetia_16", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.planet.0f284d", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "planet", "filler": "He can discover unto thee what the Earth is, and", "span": "what holdeth it up in the Waters; and what Mind", "atom_id": "goetia_17", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.element.50fdfd", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "element", "filler": "\u2014The Eleventh Spirit in order is a great and strong", "span": "Duke, called Gusion. He appeareth like a Xenopilus. He telleth", "atom_id": "goetia_18", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.symbol.5cc4fc", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "symbol", "filler": "And if he doth not enter into the triangle, \u25b3,", "span": "at your threats, rehearse the Bonds and Charms before him,", "atom_id": "goetia_19", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.concept.e500f4", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "concept", "filler": "He causeth the Love of Lords and Great Persons. He", "span": "governeth 60 Legions of Spirits. His Seal is this, etc.", "atom_id": "goetia_20", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.text.da591c", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "text", "filler": "He causeth the Love of Women to Men, and of", "span": "Men to Women; and governeth 30 Legions of Spirits. His", "atom_id": "goetia_21", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.letter.42aa8e", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "letter", "filler": "He knoweth all things Past, Present, and to Come. He", "span": "maketh men witty and bold. He governeth 36 Legions of", "atom_id": "goetia_22", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.practice.cc88ad", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "practice", "filler": "He teacheth all things Past, and to Come. If desired", "span": "he causeth the love both of Friends and of Foes.", "atom_id": "goetia_23", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.planet.fc4030", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "planet", "filler": "He appeareth in the Form of a Soldier with Red", "span": "Clothing, riding upon a Red Horse, and having a Crown", "atom_id": "goetia_24", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.element.c5c47f", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "element", "filler": "He causeth men to have a Good Name, and to", "span": "have the knowledge and understanding of Tongues. He maketh one", "atom_id": "goetia_25", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.symbol.be0a3a", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "symbol", "filler": "But as soon as the Exorcist seeth Asmoday in the", "span": "shape aforesaid, he shall call him by his Name, saying:", "atom_id": "goetia_26", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.concept.b1ebc0", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "concept", "filler": "His Seal is this to be made and to be", "span": "worn as aforesaid, etc. (34.) Furfur. \u2014The Thirty-fourth Spirit is", "atom_id": "goetia_27", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.text.7f564a", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "text", "filler": "He teacheth the Art of Astronomy, and the Virtues of", "span": "Herbs and Precious Stones. He governeth 26 Legions of Spirits;", "atom_id": "goetia_28", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.letter.706a35", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "letter", "filler": "He giveth Good Familiars. If thou makest a Sacrifice unto", "span": "him he will receive it kindly and willingly, but he", "atom_id": "goetia_29", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.practice.a7be75", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "practice", "filler": "And at the request of the Exorcist he can cause", "span": "the seas to be right stormy and to appear full", "atom_id": "goetia_30", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.planet.7eb769", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "planet", "filler": "He can discover all things that are Hidden, and not", "span": "kept by Wicked Spirits. He giveth good Familiars, sometimes. He", "atom_id": "goetia_31", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.element.0357a4", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "element", "filler": "[23] His Office is to procure the Love of Woman,", "span": "and to tell Things Past, Present, and to Come. He", "atom_id": "goetia_32", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.symbol.20642a", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "symbol", "filler": "His Office is to teach the Arts of Philosophy, Astrology,", "span": "Rhetoric, Logic, Cheiromancy, and Pyromancy, in all their parts, and", "atom_id": "goetia_33", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.concept.d56706", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "concept", "filler": "He seemeth to answer in Burning Ashes, or in Coals", "span": "of Fire. He is a Good Disputer. His Office is", "atom_id": "goetia_34", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.text.6594df", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "text", "filler": "He is very faithful unto the Exorcist, and will not", "span": "suffer him to be tempted of any Spirit. He governeth", "atom_id": "goetia_35", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.letter.7129eb", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "letter", "filler": "He giveth Good Familiars, and can bewray Treasure that is", "span": "kept by Spirits. He governeth 36 Legions of Spirits, and", "atom_id": "goetia_36", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.practice.ee2802", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "practice", "filler": "He can even make Fools wise. He governeth 33 Legions", "span": "of Spirits, and his Seal is this, etc. (62.) Volac", "atom_id": "goetia_37", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.planet.5754a5", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "planet", "filler": "He will, lastly, talk of the Creation of the World,", "span": "and of Divinity, and of how he and other Spirits", "atom_id": "goetia_38", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.element.c97b75", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "element", "filler": "Also he can cause Trees to bend and incline according", "span": "to the Exorcist\u2019s Will. He giveth Excellent Familiars. He governeth", "atom_id": "goetia_39", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.symbol.0e6338", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "symbol", "filler": "And this is his Seal, which is to be worn,", "span": "etc. (70.) Seere , Sear , or Seir .\u2014The Seventieth", "atom_id": "goetia_40", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.concept.95e949", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "concept", "filler": "(72.) Andromalius. \u2014The Seventy-second Spirit in Order is named Andromalius.", "span": "He is an Earl, Great and Mighty, appearing in the", "atom_id": "goetia_41", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.text.dc9276", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "text", "filler": "OBSERVATIONS. First, thou shalt know and observe the Moon\u2019s Age", "span": "for thy working. The best days be when the Moon", "atom_id": "goetia_42", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.letter.2fb766", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "letter", "filler": "CLASSIFIED LIST OF THE 72 CHIEF SPIRITS OF THE GOETIA,", "span": "ACCORDING TO RESPECTIVE RANK. (Seal in Gold.) Kings. \u2014(1.) Bael;", "atom_id": "goetia_43", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.practice.fdb39b", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "practice", "filler": "\u2014(50.) Furcas. Note. \u2014It will be remarked that several among", "span": "the above Spirits possess two titles of different ranks; e.g.", "atom_id": "goetia_44", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.planet.a6a4df", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "planet", "filler": "(Colours.\u2014The space between the outer and inner circles, where the", "span": "serpent is coiled, with the Hebrew names written along his", "atom_id": "goetia_45", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.element.753f38", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "element", "filler": "This is the Form of the Hexagram of Solomon, the", "span": "figure whereof is to be made on parchment of a", "atom_id": "goetia_46", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.symbol.b287e7", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "symbol", "filler": "This is the Form of the Magic Ring, or rather", "span": "Disc, of Solomon, the figure whereof is to be made", "atom_id": "goetia_47", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.concept.428e2e", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "concept", "filler": "Note that on this night the moon must be increasing", "span": "in light ( i.e. , going from new to full)", "atom_id": "goetia_48", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.text.086fff", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "text", "filler": "Figure 170 is from the site of ancient Carthage. It", "span": "is very rough in workmanship, and the designs are mere", "atom_id": "goetia_49", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.letter.9f4c4f", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "letter", "filler": "Also perfumes, and a chafing-dish of charcoal kindled to put", "span": "the fumes on, to smoke or perfume the place appointed", "atom_id": "goetia_50", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.practice.f9c219", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "practice", "filler": "And being armed with power from the Supreme Majesty ,", "span": "I do strongly command thee, by Him Who spake and", "atom_id": "goetia_51", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.planet.2309ac", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "planet", "filler": "For thou art conjured by the name of the Living", "span": "and True God , Helioren , wherefore fulfil thou my", "atom_id": "goetia_52", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.element.1bcc74", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "element", "filler": "And by these names, and by all the other names", "span": "of the Living and True God , the Lord Almighty", "atom_id": "goetia_53", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.symbol.596f8c", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "symbol", "filler": "I conjure and constrain thee, O thou Spirit N., by", "span": "all the names aforesaid; and in addition by these seven", "atom_id": "goetia_54", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.concept.8d2a5f", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "concept", "filler": "But if he do not come still, then thou mayest", "span": "be sure that he is bound in chains in hell,", "atom_id": "goetia_55", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.text.d03a2d", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "text", "filler": "After thou shalt have invocated the King in this manner", "span": "twice or thrice over, then conjure the spirit thou wouldst", "atom_id": "goetia_56", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.letter.245a01", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "letter", "filler": "I conjure thee, O fire, by him who made thee", "span": "and all other creatures for good in the world, that", "atom_id": "goetia_57", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.practice.c6f1e4", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "practice", "filler": "Let all the company of Heaven curse thee! Let the", "span": "sun, moon, and all the stars curse thee! Let the", "atom_id": "goetia_58", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.planet.725784", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "planet", "filler": "Wherefore make rational answer unto my demands, and prepare to", "span": "be obedient unto thy master in the name of the", "atom_id": "goetia_59", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.element.7bf207", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "element", "filler": "O thou Spirit N., because thou hast diligently answered unto", "span": "my demands, and hast been very ready and willing to", "atom_id": "goetia_60", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.symbol.ce204c", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "symbol", "filler": "\u2014Let thy Holy Angels be commanded to assist me at", "span": "this time and at all times. Iehovah. \u2014God Almighty, God", "atom_id": "goetia_61", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.concept.45d3bf", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "concept", "filler": "\u2014Let thy holy angel Raphael wait upon us at this", "span": "present and for ever: Schemes (or Shemesh).\u2014To assist us in", "atom_id": "goetia_62", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.text.f34881", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "text", "filler": "\u2014And appear in human shape: Bellator (or Ballaton).\u2014And speak unto", "span": "us audibly in our mother-tongue: Bellonoy (or Bellony).\u2014And show, and", "atom_id": "goetia_63", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.letter.39e3c5", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "letter", "filler": "YE FYRSTE CONJOURATIOUN. I invoke and move thee, O thou,", "span": "Spirit N.: and being exalted above ye in the power", "atom_id": "goetia_64", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.practice.ef9abe", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "practice", "filler": "Come forth, O Spirit N. in a moment: let thy", "span": "dwelling-place be empty, apply unto us the secrets of Truth", "atom_id": "goetia_65", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.planet.c5ca51", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "planet", "filler": "And in these names of secret truth, Agla, On, Tetragrammaton,", "span": "do I invoke and move thee. And in these names,", "atom_id": "goetia_66", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.element.c62c64", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "element", "filler": "I stir thee up and move thee, O spirit N.,", "span": "in all the names that I have said, and I", "atom_id": "goetia_67", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.symbol.3448e2", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Bring forth, I say, the spirit N.; bring him forth", "span": "in the 24th of a moment let his dwelling be", "atom_id": "goetia_68", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.concept.e52076", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "concept", "filler": "Therefore I say the judgment: I curse thee and destroy", "span": "the name N. and the seal N., which I have", "atom_id": "goetia_69", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.text.a198be", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "text", "filler": "Let the sun, moon, all the stars curse thee! Let", "span": "the light and all the Holy Ones of Heaven curse", "atom_id": "goetia_70", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.goetia_catalog.letter.71b1ab", "family_id": "goetia_catalog", "role": "letter", "filler": "YE WELCOME UNTO YE SPIRIT DYGNYTIE. I am he that", "span": "is looking with gladness upon thee, O thou spirit ...", "atom_id": "goetia_71", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
