{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.666221", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "I did not lose sight of my work, and became", "span": "acquainted with an old man who was called the philosopher,", "atom_id": "alchemy_325", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.37f64c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "\u201cThe year 1537 passed over without any change appearing in", "span": "the subject of our labours. We might have remained through", "atom_id": "alchemy_326", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.7a509a", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "A variety of systems were held by others, and scarcely", "span": "a day passed in which some of them did not", "atom_id": "alchemy_327", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.1e059e", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "\u201cI felt the truth of this safe counsel, but before", "span": "I put it in execution, I went to see my", "atom_id": "alchemy_328", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.0a8711", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "I then formed my plan , and only waited to", "span": "sell the remainder of my land to enable me to", "atom_id": "alchemy_329", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.4db8be", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "I thanked God for the favour he shewed me, and", "span": "prayed that I should be permitted to use it but", "atom_id": "alchemy_330", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.706c0b", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "The life of Bernard Tr\u00e9visan has abundantly testified to the", "span": "physical nature of his object, which is amply [Pg 148]", "atom_id": "alchemy_331", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.a813d8", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "Thomas Charnock was born in the Isle of Thanet, in", "span": "the year 1524. He calls himself an unlettered scholar, and", "atom_id": "alchemy_332", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.c0a0a2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "He promised Charnock that if he made a vow not", "span": "to reveal the secret for gold, preferment, or through affection", "atom_id": "alchemy_333", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.48eb48", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "He sent for Charnock, made him the heir of his", "span": "work, and died after giving him instructions how to proceed.", "atom_id": "alchemy_334", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.b324e4", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "Furious with disappointment, he took a hatchet, smashed his glasses,", "span": "furnace, and apparatus, and threw them out of the house.", "atom_id": "alchemy_335", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.ba9902", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "They were also published separately under the title De Alchimia", "span": "dialogi duo , Lugd., 1548, 4to . The Wood of", "atom_id": "alchemy_336", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.599f0f", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "FOOTNOTES: [W] Dictionnaire des Sciences Occultes , i. p. 232.", "span": "[Pg 153] LEONARDI FIORAVANTI. Doctor, surgeon, and alchemist of the", "atom_id": "alchemy_337", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.7d4d33", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "During this sojourn an old manuscript was shown him by", "span": "[Pg 154] the innkeeper, which was indecipherable by himself or", "atom_id": "alchemy_338", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.c71ee0", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "When Edward Kelly, with an assumed antiquarian indifference about objects", "span": "which were more curious than valuable, offered a pound sterling", "atom_id": "alchemy_339", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.024778", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "The last abbot was hanged by Henry VIII. for his", "span": "adherence to the Papal cause. Kelly appears to have taken", "atom_id": "alchemy_340", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.597efa", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "The most authenticated and remarkable, according to Figuier, is that", "span": "which took place in the house of the imperial physician,", "atom_id": "alchemy_341", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.4ef957", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "The Book of St Dunstan indicated the use but not", "span": "the preparation of the powder, and their experiments, vigilantly overwatched", "atom_id": "alchemy_342", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.72572d", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "In 1607 we again find him at Mortlake, living on", "span": "the revenue which he derived from Manchester, but subject to", "atom_id": "alchemy_343", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.09fc41", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "The self same sonne troys yet more, ye must wounde,", "span": "Still with new knives, of the same kinde, and grounde;", "atom_id": "alchemy_344", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.8aece0", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "The second was an Echo Colloquii , by Benedict Hilarion,", "span": "writing in the name of the Rosicrucian Fraternity. It appears", "atom_id": "alchemy_345", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.faeecd", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "Jacob B\u00f6hme, who may perhaps be considered as the central", "span": "figure of Christian mysticism, was born in the year 1575,", "atom_id": "alchemy_346", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.6618ed", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "He was forbidden to write any more books, and was", "span": "commanded to stick to his trade. For five years he", "atom_id": "alchemy_347", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.74f408", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "A treatise on metallurgy is ascribed to the theosophist [Pg", "span": "165] himself, and there are several alchemical references in his", "atom_id": "alchemy_348", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.2d6788", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "This author, so illustrious throughout Europe for his scientific knowledge,", "span": "and no less celebrated for his noble rank than by", "atom_id": "alchemy_349", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.bec004", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "On these grounds he believed in the certainty and in", "span": "the prodigious resources of the art, citing his acquaintance with", "atom_id": "alchemy_350", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.e5bc13", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "He was therefore liberated from the prison in which he", "span": "had been confined during the investigation. Butler was afterwards entombed", "atom_id": "alchemy_351", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.cadcd4", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "D\u2019Espagnet is also the author of the preface to the", "span": "Tableau de l\u2019Inconstance des D\u00e9mons , by Pierre Delancre. \u201cThe", "atom_id": "alchemy_352", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.d59d0d", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "He was a native of Scotland, and is supposed to", "span": "have inhabited a mansion at a village in the vicinity", "atom_id": "alchemy_353", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.c68c4c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "To this adversary we are indebted for a description of", "span": "Sethon, whom he declared eminently spiritual in appearance, short in", "atom_id": "alchemy_354", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.d460e6", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "[AD] Leaving Cologne altogether petrified by his marvellous operations, the", "span": "illustrious hierophant of the art Hermetic betook himself to Hamburg,", "atom_id": "alchemy_355", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.5ccf77", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "He imprisoned him in a tower, which was guarded by", "span": "forty soldiers, who had strict orders to keep a constant", "atom_id": "alchemy_356", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.e42223", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "Cologne, 1604. [AE] Galdenfalk, \u201cAlchemical Anecdotes.\u201d MICHAEL SENDIVOGIUS. Sendivogius, whose", "span": "true name was Sensophax, was born at Moravia in 1566,", "atom_id": "alchemy_357", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.81792d", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Foiled in this attempt, he was still anxious at any", "span": "rate to appear as an adept, and acquired an immense", "atom_id": "alchemy_358", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.59a712", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "From the Court of Rodolph II. the alchemist proceeded to", "span": "that of Poland. As he passed on his way through", "atom_id": "alchemy_359", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.0f78b5", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "Sendivogius, once more vividly reminded of the fate of his", "span": "master, precipitately fled, only to be pursued by his treacherous", "atom_id": "alchemy_360", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.5c6b92", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "[AF] The elixir relieved the same king from the effects", "span": "of a serious accident. When every particle of his powder", "atom_id": "alchemy_361", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.c27733", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "They presented him with a letter bearing twelve seals, and", "span": "addressed to Sendivogius. He declared that he was not the", "atom_id": "alchemy_362", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.b7622d", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "On the contrary, he which, in a philosophical way, can,", "span": "without any fraud and colourable deceit, make it that it", "atom_id": "alchemy_363", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.db585c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "There was no appearance of soldering, or of the possibility", "span": "of deception. [AG] See Vie de Sendivogius, tir\u00e9e de la", "atom_id": "alchemy_364", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.c3f845", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Upon this information, Richtausen adroitly got possession of the powder,", "span": "and then departed. The nobleman, hearing of the transaction, threatened", "atom_id": "alchemy_365", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.7eddf0", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "Athanasius Kircher, the illustrious German Jesuit, records, in his Mundus", "span": "Subterraneus , that one of his friends, whose veracity he", "atom_id": "alchemy_366", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.7a395c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "I became almost stupid, and, as another Cr\u0153sus, fancied I", "span": "possessed all the riches in the universe. My gratitude to", "atom_id": "alchemy_367", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.e0489b", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "It was published in duodecimo at Paris in 1664, and", "span": "has since been reprinted. In the dedicatory epistle the authorship", "atom_id": "alchemy_368", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.382f10", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "Second, the fact that almost every edition and translation of", "span": "this treatise contains the following passage in the initial paragraph", "atom_id": "alchemy_369", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.eacb45", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "[Pg 190] If much be confusion which concerns Thomas Vaughan,", "span": "all is chaos in respect of Eiren\u00e6us Philalethes. He would", "atom_id": "alchemy_370", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.ea32e1", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "Whoever encounters the eminent peril of his life will act", "span": "with more caution thenceforward. I found the world in a", "atom_id": "alchemy_371", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.34acbf", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "I do not remember that ever I learned anything from", "span": "Raymond Lully. Some who are not adepts give more instruction", "atom_id": "alchemy_372", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.bf8b37", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "These also fell into the hands of one who, I", "span": "conceive, will never restore them.\u201d The delinquent in question was", "atom_id": "alchemy_373", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.19a526", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "I essayed the medicine on copper, iron, even on brass", "span": "and pewter, on spelter, solder, tinglass, mercury, and on regulus", "atom_id": "alchemy_374", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.782b08", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "He is scarcely thirty-three years of age, and is rarely", "span": "learned. You cannot [Pg 197] know more of him from", "atom_id": "alchemy_375", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.29152f", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "\u201cWhen I found that my vain attempts only threw away", "span": "the tincture, I stopped my hand, resolving to keep the", "atom_id": "alchemy_376", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.6236da", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "While you were ignorant, I gave you a great gift,", "span": "so that, if Heaven ordained, the gift should destroy itself.", "atom_id": "alchemy_377", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.85ebd2", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "And seeing you know the art of preparing the fiery", "span": "mercury , you might have as much store as any", "atom_id": "alchemy_378", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.50078e", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Those who are in search of the physical secret should", "span": "begin by the careful study of his works; thence they", "atom_id": "alchemy_379", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.58ac8d", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "His most curious work is Alchimista Christianus . Toulouse, 1632,", "span": "8vo . In Hercules Piochymicus , published at the same", "atom_id": "alchemy_380", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.e6bad1", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "He asked me if I still thought there was no", "span": "medicine in Nature which could cure all diseases, unless the", "atom_id": "alchemy_381", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.bc4f03", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "\u201cI was in great admiration, and desired to know where", "span": "and how he obtained them. He answered, \u2018A foreigner, who", "atom_id": "alchemy_382", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.67c1ec", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "It proved most excellent pure gold, which the stranger said", "span": "brought him into such trembling amazement that he could hardly", "atom_id": "alchemy_383", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.80c335", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "\u2018Not so, not so,\u2019 said he, \u2018for we ought to", "span": "divulge all things to the children of art which may", "atom_id": "alchemy_384", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.ea76c1", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "Amongst the rest, the general Assay-master, examiner of coins of", "span": "this province of Holland, Mr Porelius, who with others earnestly", "atom_id": "alchemy_385", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.3966af", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Finally, with a contradiction more French than Italian, he gave", "span": "out that he was himself the Holy Spirit incarnate. Needless", "atom_id": "alchemy_386", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.1d34a3", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "Five years passed away, and Frederick III. having died, his", "span": "successor determined on a closer investigation of the transmutatory secrets", "atom_id": "alchemy_387", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.74ced6", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "The account of his voyage to the land of the", "span": "Rosicrucians is a mangled version of Bacon\u2019s \u201cAtlantis;\u201d his apologues,", "atom_id": "alchemy_388", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.a5a7b4", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "His mission in the West was the solicitation of alms", "span": "for the [Pg 212] ransom of Christian prisoners in the", "atom_id": "alchemy_389", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.1a2216", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "The experiment was repeated with mercury for the benefit of", "span": "a friend of B\u00f6tticher, the tale spread, and the apothecary\u2019s", "atom_id": "alchemy_390", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.98fdc7", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "Their man\u0153uvres resulted in the imprisonment of Pasch at the", "span": "fortress of Sonneinstein, while B\u00f6tticher was closely confined in another", "atom_id": "alchemy_391", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.9ecff7", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "In the meantime, Lascaris himself was not idle. On the", "span": "16th February 1609 he is believed to have changed mercury", "atom_id": "alchemy_392", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.7cabb9", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "In a word, every anonymous adept who appeared at this", "span": "period in or about Germany is supposed to be Lascaris.", "atom_id": "alchemy_393", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.6125ae", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "In Lenglet\u2019s \u201cHistory of Hermetic Philosophy,\u201d there is a letter", "span": "from the Bishop of Senez to the Minister of State", "atom_id": "alchemy_394", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.18fe02", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "Afterwards three ounces of pistol bullets were melted and purified", "span": "with alum and saltpetre. Delisle handed Saint-Maurice a small paper,", "atom_id": "alchemy_395", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.b983d5", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "His illegitimate son, Alnys, by some means inherited a portion", "span": "of the powder from his mother. He wandered through Italy", "atom_id": "alchemy_396", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.practice.eef3e6", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "practice", "filler": "This Altotas, or Althotes, we are assured by Figuier, was", "span": "no imaginary character. The Roman Inquisition collected many proofs of", "atom_id": "alchemy_397", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.planet.648921", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "planet", "filler": "The sale of a certain wash for beautifying the complexion", "span": "appears to have procured him a considerable revenue about this", "atom_id": "alchemy_398", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.element.edc4b3", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "element", "filler": "Monsieur Saint-F\u00e9lix, however, declares, and this, on the whole, is", "span": "most probable, that they were received with the most marked", "atom_id": "alchemy_399", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.symbol.326e51", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "symbol", "filler": "According to the M\u00e9moires Authentiques pour servir \u00e0 l\u2019Histoire du", "span": "Comte de Cagliostro , published in 1785, he demanded an", "atom_id": "alchemy_400", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.concept.26609c", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "concept", "filler": "Whence come you? What would you?\u201d Then the Count and", "span": "Countess Cagliostro prostrated themselves, and the former answered after a", "atom_id": "alchemy_401", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.text.bf8468", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "text", "filler": "When he took possession of my soul he caused me", "span": "to perceive all objects in a new light; I began", "atom_id": "alchemy_402", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.alchemy_spirit.letter.958abc", "family_id": "alchemy_spirit", "role": "letter", "filler": "Like the rest of the townsfolk he had come out", "span": "to behold the phenomenal personage [Pg 253] whose arrival was", "atom_id": "alchemy_403", "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
