{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.text.d2a658", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "text", "filler": "Then followed what are termed \"the Seven Divine Generations,\" among", "span": "which we find such names as \"the Earthly-eternally-standing-Deity,\" \"the Mud-Earth-Lord,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
