{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.planet.aa87bf", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "planet", "filler": "(3) Another object of special interest is the Go-hei ,", "span": "a slender wand, originally a branch of the sacred tree", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.element.307dd6", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "element", "filler": "Over the whole is placed a sort of cage of", "span": "unpainted wood with orna [Pg 37] ments said to be", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.symbol.41756d", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "symbol", "filler": "[23] We have seen that Japanese history and mythology run", "span": "together and blend in remarkable artlessness as they stand recorded", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.concept.88f8c2", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "concept", "filler": "The individual must always stand ready to be sacrificed for", "span": "the good of the community or of the State. Everything", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.text.d2a658", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "text", "filler": "But the cult implies beyond question a belief in some", "span": "kind of future life. The Yomi , or Hades, of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.letter.048d50", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "letter", "filler": "Here the old mythology of the Ko-ji-ki comes in to", "span": "tell us of a prehistoric and cosmical origin of evils.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
