{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.symbol.41756d", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "symbol", "filler": "As it grows up it is regularly taken to observe", "span": "all the festivals and the processions and ceremonies, and the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.concept.88f8c2", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "concept", "filler": "The substance and manner of this worship may be learned", "span": "from the ancient Japanese rituals, which make mention of the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.text.d2a658", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "text", "filler": "The reader of the ritual was a member of the", "span": "priestly tribe which traced its origin to Oho-nakato-mi , chief", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.letter.048d50", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "letter", "filler": "The various offerings are duly presented and the ritual is", "span": "read. At the conclusion of each section of the ritual", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.practice.7944ec", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "practice", "filler": "The names also of many deities are declared: the \"divine", "span": "Producer,\" the \"great Goddess of Food,\" \"wonderful-rock-Gate,\" \"the from-heaven-shining-great Deity", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.planet.aa87bf", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "planet", "filler": "Without detailing the movements, positions, and practices of the assembled", "span": "priests, officials, and common people at the service of the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.element.307dd6", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "element", "filler": "The ritual also makes mention of various kinds of offenses", "span": "which need to be cleansed and purged away, and distinguishes", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.symbol.41756d", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "symbol", "filler": "So they were cast down into the depths whence they", "span": "came forth. The concluding words of this ritual are a", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.concept.88f8c2", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "concept", "filler": "(4) We should also remark that while, according to the", "span": "ritual of the Great Purification, it is expected that from", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
