{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.planet.aa87bf", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "planet", "filler": "Our inquiry is after the facts and the significance of", "span": "the essential Shinto cult. A great and remarkable revival of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.element.307dd6", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "element", "filler": "Percival Lowell observes that this reinstatement [Pg 70] of the", "span": "Mikado and the old national faith is \"a curious instance", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.symbol.41756d", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "symbol", "filler": "It may have its connections with Buddhist counting of rosaries,", "span": "and possibly other foreign influences have helped to cultivate its", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.concept.88f8c2", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "concept", "filler": "But in any case it would seem that one who", "span": "deems the Japanese either irreligious, or non-religious, or deficient in", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.text.d2a658", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "text", "filler": "\"For from within,\" He said, \"out of the heart of", "span": "man, evil thoughts proceed, fornications, thefts, murders, adulteries, covetings, wickedness,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.letter.048d50", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "letter", "filler": "These animistic conceptions have played a noteworthy part in connection", "span": "with most, if not all, the religions of mankind. When", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.practice.7944ec", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "practice", "filler": "The new conception need have no conflict with the belief", "span": "that the spirits of the dead are all about us,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.planet.aa87bf", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "planet", "filler": "He counts it sweet and glorious to die for his", "span": "country. He is not his own; he belongs to the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
