{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.symbol.41756d", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "symbol", "filler": "] \" He says: 'I humbly declare in the presence", "span": "of the Sovran Gods of the harvest. \" 'If the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.concept.88f8c2", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "concept", "filler": "Repeating your names, to wit, Iku-kuni (live country) and Taru-kuni", "span": "[238] (perfect country), I fulfil your praises. Because you the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.text.d2a658", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "text", "filler": "Therefore do I now fulfil your praises by making these", "span": "plenteous offerings on his behalf. \" 'Lend ear, all of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.letter.048d50", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "letter", "filler": "I, of such a rank, of such a name, humbly", "span": "repeat his commands, as his envoy to convey hither and", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.practice.7944ec", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "practice", "filler": "\"'Hearken, all ye kannushi and mono-imi.' \"He says: 'This service", "span": "is likewise addressed to the Aramatsuri shrine and to the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.planet.aa87bf", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "planet", "filler": "A similar form was used in the case of the", "span": "Food-Goddess. Oho-tono hogahi (luck-wishing or blessing of the Great Palace).--This", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
