{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.letter.048d50", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "letter", "filler": "The application of the harahi to the purpose of a", "span": "fine was regulated by an ordinance which was issued in", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.practice.7944ec", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "practice", "filler": "The prayer addressed to the Gods is as follows:-- \"In", "span": "reverence and awe: The great gods of the purification place", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.planet.aa87bf", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "planet", "filler": "Pilgrims received these in return for their offerings. The devout", "span": "could even purchase them from hawkers, who went about the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.element.307dd6", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "element", "filler": "An offering [Pg 306] was made of a silver man", "span": "in order that calamity might be averted from him, and", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.symbol.41756d", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "symbol", "filler": "There is a reader of spells called Daikoku Matsudaiyu, who", "span": "has four followers, two old men and two old women.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
