{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.practice.7944ec", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "practice", "filler": "On the domestic shrine is placed an offering of unleavened", "span": "cakes of glutinous pounded rice, the preparation of which is", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
