{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.element.307dd6", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "element", "filler": "Offerings of cloth, a mirror, jewels, bows and arrows, swords,", "span": "a horse, sake, rice in ear and in grain, and", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.symbol.41756d", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "symbol", "filler": "The Urabe kindled a fire by means of the fire-drill", "span": "and worshipped it. The following norito (No. 12) was read", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.concept.88f8c2", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "concept", "filler": "Moreover, she taught him, saying, \"When the temper of this", "span": "evil-hearted child becomes violent, do thou assuage it with the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.text.d2a658", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "text", "filler": "It was celebrated twice annually by a priestess despatched from", "span": "Ki\u014dto to Nara for the purpose. I take from Sir", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.letter.048d50", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "letter", "filler": "A silk umbrella and a huge long-handled fan were borne", "span": "on [Pg 318] either side of the car by four", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.practice.7944ec", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "practice", "filler": "At the boundary of the province of Yamato she was", "span": "received by officers of the Provincial Government, who accompanied her", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
