{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.symbol.41756d", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "symbol", "filler": "After the sake -cup had been passed round three times,", "span": "the company clapped their hands once and separated. Then everybody", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.concept.88f8c2", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "concept", "filler": "The \"golden thread-box,\" \"golden shuttle,\" and \"golden reel\" enumerated in", "span": "this norito as offerings to the Goddess were in reality", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
