{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.letter.048d50", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "letter", "filler": "The infant is represented by a doll. The date selected", "span": "for this ceremony is not immaterial. It is that of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
