{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.letter.048d50", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "letter", "filler": "The latter complains that there is a tendency among physicians", "span": "of the Chinese school to neglect it. Some diseases, he", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
