{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.text.d2a658", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "text", "filler": "Koto-ura (harp-divination) was formerly (11th century) practised at Ise with", "span": "the object of ascertaining whether the priests who were to", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.letter.048d50", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "letter", "filler": "If the sound produced resembles the bellowing of a bull,", "span": "the prognostic is good, if otherwise, it is bad. Divination", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
