{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.element.307dd6", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "element", "filler": "For the reasons above stated I prefer to regard such", "span": "cases as abnormal and exceptional. The Kojiki and Nihongi have", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.symbol.41756d", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "symbol", "filler": "In what we call inspiration, the two former are, as", "span": "far as may be, in abeyance, and the mind is", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.concept.88f8c2", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "concept", "filler": "Some are of a physical nature. The moderate use of", "span": "certain drugs and stimulants is an acknowledged help towards producing", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.text.d2a658", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "text", "filler": "The Goddess Uzume gave forth an \"inspired utterance\" as part", "span": "of her performance before the Rock-cave of Heaven into which", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.letter.048d50", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "letter", "filler": "A certain man, inspired by the Moon-God, said, 'My forefather", "span": "Taka-musubi had the merit of creating Heaven and Earth. Let", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.practice.7944ec", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "practice", "filler": "He also made offerings of cloth and worshipped the Gods", "span": "of the Shrines of Takechi and Musa. \"After this Karakuni,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.planet.aa87bf", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "planet", "filler": "Such extraordinary assertions evince a want of loyalty both to", "span": "the Gods and to the Mikado. Their disregard of the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
