{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.symbol.41756d", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "symbol", "filler": "The purification of the place consists in enclosing the spot", "span": "with strings, from which depend at intervals small gohei ,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.concept.88f8c2", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "concept", "filler": "For a few minutes, the time varying with the particular", "span": "naka-za , the man remains perfectly motionless. Then suddenly the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
