{"pair_id": "corr.shinto_onmyodo.letter.048d50", "family_id": "shinto_onmyodo", "role": "letter", "filler": "The official Shinto mode of ascertaining the will of the", "span": "Gods was by the \"Greater Divination,\" that is, by the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
