{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.planet.68904c", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "planet", "filler": "GUY MANNERING, By Sir Walter Scott GUY MANNERING, By Sir", "span": "Walter Scott *** START OF THE PROJECT GUTENBERG EBOOK 5999", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.element.2f513c", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "element", "filler": "Let me only request that I may be informed of", "span": "the exact minute of the birth; and I hope to", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.symbol.7c8b84", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "symbol", "filler": "He hastened to draw the stranger into a private room.", "span": "\u2018I fear from your looks,\u2019 said the father, \u2018that you", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.concept.be6e1f", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "concept", "filler": "You must regard him as a being separated from the", "span": "rest of the world. In childhood, in boyhood, you must", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.text.d942bb", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "text", "filler": "Besides, it occurred that to do justice to such a", "span": "subject would have required not only more talent than the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.letter.cf359b", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "letter", "filler": "He constructed a scheme of his own nativity, calculated according", "span": "to such rules of art as he could collect from", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.practice.6e119a", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "practice", "filler": "The fact, if truly reported, is one of those singular", "span": "coincidences which occasionally appear, differing so widely from ordinary calculation,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.planet.68904c", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "planet", "filler": "There are sparks both of pathos and of humour, even", "span": "in the dullest parts, which could be elicited from none", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.element.2f513c", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "element", "filler": "\u2018Aweel, Ellangowan,\u2019 she said, \u2018wad it no hae been a", "span": "bonnie thing, an the leddy had been brought to bed,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.symbol.7c8b84", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "symbol", "filler": "And there\u2019s Dunbog has warned the Red Rotten and John", "span": "Young aff his grunds--black be his cast! he\u2019s nae gentleman,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.concept.be6e1f", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "concept", "filler": "Or I will begin ab hora questionis, as Haly, Messahala,", "span": "Ganwehis, and Guido Bonatus have recommended.\u2019 One of Sampson\u2019s great", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.text.d942bb", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "text", "filler": "\u2018Really,\u2019 resumed the traveller, \u2018I am sorry to see a", "span": "gentleman of your learning and gravity labouring under such strange", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.letter.cf359b", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "letter", "filler": "Signs and planets, in aspects sextile, quartile, trine, conjoined, or", "span": "opposite; houses of heaven, with their cusps, hours, and minutes;", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.practice.6e119a", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "practice", "filler": "But still the heart doth need a language, still Doth", "span": "the old instinct bring back the old names. And to", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.planet.68904c", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "planet", "filler": "CHAPTER IV Come and see\u2019 trust thine own eyes A", "span": "fearful sign stands in the house of life, An enemy", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.element.2f513c", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "element", "filler": "He undertook the task secundum artem, as well to keep", "span": "up appearances as from a sort of curiosity to know", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.symbol.7c8b84", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Struck with this coincidence, Mannering repeated his calculations; and the", "span": "result approximated the events predicted, until at length the same", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.concept.be6e1f", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "concept", "filler": "Curious to investigate the manners of the country, Mannering took", "span": "the advantage of a pause in good Mr. Bertram\u2019s string", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.text.d942bb", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "text", "filler": "Mannering, however, was determined in his own mind not to", "span": "expose the infant to the inconveniences which might have arisen", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.letter.cf359b", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "letter", "filler": "Bertram of Ellangowan was able to hear the news of", "span": "what had passed during her confinement, her apartment rung with", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.practice.6e119a", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "practice", "filler": "You should have had Lucy Bertram too for your friend,", "span": "whose fathers, with names which alike defy memory and orthography,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.planet.68904c", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "planet", "filler": "I have a notion, however, this gipsy could tell us", "span": "some more of the matter than she derives from astrology", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.element.2f513c", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "element", "filler": "Margaret,\u2019 repeated Sampson, stoutly; \u2018I will deliver unto him the", "span": "sealed epistle, and will add what you please to send", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.symbol.7c8b84", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "symbol", "filler": "The Project Gutenberg eBook of The true prophecies and prognostications", "span": "of Michael Nostradamus, by Theophilus de Garencieres. *** START OF", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.concept.be6e1f", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "concept", "filler": "The third is, that he marketh the times with Astrological", "span": "terms, viz. when such and such Planets, shall be in", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.text.d942bb", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "text", "filler": "For these reasons (dear Reader) I would not have thee", "span": "intangle thy self in the pretentions of knowing future things.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.letter.cf359b", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "letter", "filler": "The second was C\u00e6sar Nostradamus , who hath deserved to", "span": "be numbred among the French Historians, by reason of the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.practice.6e119a", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "practice", "filler": "the knowledge of future events. Besides that, there was four", "span": "things in him, which might have been the grounds of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.planet.68904c", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "planet", "filler": "John the Evangelist. This seemeth altogether improbable to Christian piety.", "span": "CHAP. III. The second Objection hath ranked the Author among", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.element.2f513c", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "element", "filler": "CHAP. IV. The third Objection accuseth the Author of medling", "span": "with the black Art, of being a Negromancer, and a", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.symbol.7c8b84", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "symbol", "filler": "He writteth all these things of himself: First, in his", "span": "Liminary Epistle to his Son C\u00e6sar , he conjureth him,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.concept.be6e1f", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "concept", "filler": "Effectively, the Author compareth this participation to a glistering flame,", "span": "which createth a new day in our understanding, which flame", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.text.d942bb", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "text", "filler": "Sometimes also (saith he) this Light cometh the first into", "span": "the Astrologers mind, and he afterwards comparing the thing revealed", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.letter.cf359b", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "letter", "filler": "The second thing that was in Nostradamus is, that he", "span": "had naturally a Genius for the knowing of future things,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.practice.6e119a", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "practice", "filler": "And in the Epistle to King Henry the II. he", "span": "seemeth to confess, that his Prophecie is nothing but a", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.planet.68904c", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "planet", "filler": "Quia non est nostrum nosse tempora nec momenta , &c.", "span": "Besides, although there is, or may come some persons, to", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.element.2f513c", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "element", "filler": "I say not therefore my Son, that you may not", "span": "understand me well, because the knowledge of this matter cannot", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.symbol.7c8b84", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "symbol", "filler": "therefore my Son, thou mayst notwithstanding thy tender brain comprehend", "span": "things that shall happen hereafter, and may be foretold by", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.concept.be6e1f", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "concept", "filler": "that what is predicted is true, and hath taken its", "span": "original from above, and such light and small flame is", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.text.d942bb", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "text", "filler": "Come now my Son, and understand what I find by", "span": "my revolutions, which are agreeing with the Divine Inspiration, viz.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.letter.cf359b", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "letter", "filler": "FRANCIS II. And CHARLES IX. Kings of FRANCE , and", "span": "one of the most excellent Astronomers that ever were. CENTURY", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.practice.6e119a", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "practice", "filler": "ANNOT. The Author having premonished us in his Preface, that", "span": "God having imparted to him the knowledge of many future", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.planet.68904c", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "planet", "filler": "Although, saith he, the Planet of Mars maketh an end", "span": "of its course, and is come to its last Period:", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.element.2f513c", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "element", "filler": "And by the horrid perfidiousness of Cromwel . Germany hath", "span": "made it good by the War against the Turks ,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
