{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.concept.be6e1f", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "concept", "filler": "Feelings of jealousy will also be experienced which will incline", "span": "to caustic utterances and sarcasm, when vexed or offended, for", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
