{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.practice.6e119a", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "practice", "filler": "You are benevolent, generous and humane, and are always ready", "span": "to help those who deserve it and to assist worthy", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.planet.68904c", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "planet", "filler": "The ancient Magi claims that all persons born on this", "span": "date, under these planetary conditions will prove exceptionally good, or", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.element.2f513c", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "element", "filler": "\u2014 p \u2014 This sign indicates that everything in life", "span": "is a pretty even struggle between good and bad, and", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.symbol.7c8b84", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "symbol", "filler": "\u2014 r \u2014 Ninth House: Sagittarius influence; Spirit focusing through", "span": "the planet Jupiter , the planet of business, generosity and", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.concept.be6e1f", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "concept", "filler": "It brings the BLESSING of money in a deeper sense.", "span": "CAPRICORN SUB-LUMA Sign No. 10 \u2014 p \u2014 The Capricorn", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.text.d942bb", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "text", "filler": "The best lesson that Saturn teaches is self-control, prudence, patience,", "span": "chastity, thrift and the meditative mind, as well as to", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
