{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.planet.68904c", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "planet", "filler": "2, Page VIII Window or Light of Soul of Man,", "span": "12 Words express meanings of letters, 1--b Wrong or right,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.element.2f513c", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "element", "filler": "During the middle ages and the period [129] of the", "span": "Renaissance comparatively few physical experiments were made. Whatever researches in", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.symbol.7c8b84", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "symbol", "filler": "But natural philosophy once lost in such a labyrinth, an", "span": "aberration of the perceptive powers can not fail to follow\u2014at", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.concept.be6e1f", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "concept", "filler": "Woche. 1901, No. 41). How primeval peoples came to connect", "span": "their destinies with the heavenly bodies and their orbits is", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.text.d942bb", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "text", "filler": "Every one who had ever followed with his eye their", "span": "courses for a few nights during a caravan journey, every", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.letter.cf359b", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "letter", "filler": "In boundless distances above it moved the moon and the", "span": "six other planets, each one in its transparent heaven. In", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.practice.6e119a", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "practice", "filler": "As this life-giving power of the sun had a conspicuous", "span": "share in the origin of primeval sabianism, so also it", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.planet.68904c", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "planet", "filler": "This is furthermore proved by the unparalleled popularity which astrology", "span": "has enjoyed in all phases of civilization. There is no", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.element.2f513c", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "element", "filler": "The above survey indicates, altho only in very general outlines,", "span": "the origin of astrology. We shall now consider more in", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.symbol.7c8b84", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "symbol", "filler": "When civilization, later on, continued to thrive upon the shores", "span": "of the Nile, astrology [140] still found a fertile soil", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.concept.be6e1f", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "concept", "filler": "FIG. 3\u2014THE TABLE OF DEMOCRITUS There existed a great many", "span": "other methods besides those described above; for instance, the [146]", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.text.d942bb", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "text", "filler": "However, various other passages of the Corpus Hippocraticum take an", "span": "exactly contrary position. For example, we find the following statement", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.letter.cf359b", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "letter", "filler": "The above quotations refer exclusively to the course of diseases", "span": "in relation to the stars, but we find in other", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.practice.6e119a", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "practice", "filler": "A calamity was supposed to assume various aspects, according to", "span": "the position and form of the comet. Under some circumstances,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.planet.68904c", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "planet", "filler": "Thus, for instance, the head to Aries, etc. Altho the", "span": "further development of Occidental as well as Oriental astrology drew", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.element.2f513c", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "element", "filler": "Let us now scrutinize more minutely the condition of Medicina", "span": "Astrologica in the second century, A.D. The works of Ptolemy,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.symbol.7c8b84", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "symbol", "filler": "This was done in the \u201cCentiloquium\u201d of Ptolemy, a work", "span": "which in a hundred brief sayings brings an epitome of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.concept.be6e1f", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "concept", "filler": "In the first place, every portion of the human frame", "span": "was placed under the influence of a certain celestial body.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.text.d942bb", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "text", "filler": "Jupiter governs the lungs, the ribs, cartilages, the liver, arteries,", "span": "the pulse, and the development of human semen; causes the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.letter.cf359b", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "letter", "filler": "Fig. 4 is a reproduction of this plate of Bartisch.", "span": "The sun, moon, planets, and zodiac regulated not only the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.practice.6e119a", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "practice", "filler": "Jupiter again takes control during the ninth month, and, as", "span": "this star is fond of warmth and humidity, and, therefore,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.planet.68904c", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "planet", "filler": "FIG. 4\u2014THE RELATION OF THE PARTS OF THE HUMAN BODY", "span": "TO THE SIGNS OF THE ZODIAC After the young mortal", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.element.2f513c", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "element", "filler": "After the appearance of the disease was dated in such", "span": "a manner, the heavenly body, in the ascendant at this", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.symbol.7c8b84", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "symbol", "filler": "If an individual complained, for instance, of disturbed digestion, and", "span": "if the heavenly body that presided over the liver presented", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.concept.be6e1f", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "concept", "filler": "Ambrose, St. Augustine, Bede, Georgius Valla, and others. Not satisfied", "span": "with this statement, Rantzau also mentions in his catalog a", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.text.d942bb", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "text", "filler": "Astrology, moreover, was not satisfied with the prognostic and diagnostic", "span": "activity which we have just mentioned, but it also interfered", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.letter.cf359b", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "letter", "filler": "The primeval Babylonian directed that the body must not be", "span": "touched with iron during certain conjunctions of the stars, and", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.practice.6e119a", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "practice", "filler": "Thus, a withdrawal of blood from veins on the right", "span": "side of the body was said to yield an essentially", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.planet.68904c", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "planet", "filler": "Thus, for instance, the period from the first quadrature of", "span": "the moon to the opposition was said to be excellent", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.element.2f513c", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "element", "filler": "The contents of such calendaria are beyond description. Apart from", "span": "remarks which referred to all occurrences of civil life, was", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.symbol.7c8b84", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "symbol", "filler": "[174] FIG. 5\u2014VENESECTION IN ITS ASTRONOMICAL CONNECTION Explanation of Fig.", "span": "5 A. The astronomic signs which are noted on the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.concept.be6e1f", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "concept", "filler": "He says: \u201c Cum septimum locum atque ejus dominum in", "span": "\u00e6gritudine afflictum videris, medicum mutato. \u201d It appears certain, accordingly,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.text.d942bb", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "text", "filler": "Astrology did not become resurrected until scholasticism and dogmatism had", "span": "held back the activity of the mind from independent investigation,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.letter.cf359b", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "letter", "filler": "Very soon after the death of the star-learned Hohenstaufen emperor,", "span": "two highly talented physicians bound themselves body and soul to", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.practice.6e119a", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "practice", "filler": "Thus, for instance, Thomas Erastus (died 1583) the well-known opponent", "span": "of Paracelsus, tells us that, as body-physician to the reigning", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.planet.68904c", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "planet", "filler": "The physician, with his earthly appliances, was always led astray", "span": "as soon as metaphysical ideas had victoriously entered pathology. History", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.element.2f513c", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "element", "filler": "Censorinus also, De Die natali, cap. ii. says, \u2018that the", "span": "opinion that the human race is perpetual, has for its", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.symbol.7c8b84", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "symbol", "filler": "But when the moisture of air corrupts the heat of", "span": "fire, from both of them fire will be generated; for", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.concept.be6e1f", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "concept", "filler": "The obliquity of the zodiac, also, is well posited with", "span": "respect to the motion of the sun, for it likewise", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.text.d942bb", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "text", "filler": "\u201cBut some others, as Ocellus, who was the precursor of", "span": "Tim\u00e6us, attribute two powers to each of the elements; to", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
