{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.concept.be6e1f", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "concept", "filler": "Hence they were of opinion that this time, in which", "span": "the manners of men were cultivated by learning, and naturally", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
