{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.concept.be6e1f", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "concept", "filler": "If therefore the planets should again meet in the same", "span": "point of Cancer, this concurrence will be one period of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.text.d942bb", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "text", "filler": "This motion, however, is completed in such a length of", "span": "time, that the life of man is not sufficiently extended", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.letter.cf359b", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "letter", "filler": "Hence, as we not only denominate the progression of the", "span": "sun from the kalends of January to the same kalends,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.practice.6e119a", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "practice", "filler": "Hence, when one age is finished, and another is about", "span": "to commence, a certain wonderful sign will present itself, either", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.planet.68904c", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "planet", "filler": "Monsieur Bailly observes [58] , that by calculation it appears,", "span": "[82] that Jupiter and Mercury were then in the same", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.astrology_west.element.2f513c", "family_id": "astrology_west", "role": "element", "filler": "That of the sun is more slow, for it is", "span": "accomplished in a year. That of Jupiter is still slower,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
