{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "299 n. 1; Manichaean Mother of Life derived from, ii.", "span": "300 n. 2 Athamas the Pythagorean, his doctrine of \u201croots,\u201d", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
