{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "75; Alexandrian clergy divided into seculars and regulars like that", "span": "of, i. 79; preserves or revives features of Isis-worship, i.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
