{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "It was doubtless to this that the text \u201cBe ye", "span": "wise as serpents, harmless as doves\u201d refers. Both serpents and", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
