{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "These things I will tell you in the emanation of", "span": "the universe. Pist. Soph. p. 225, Copt. 487 . Ibid.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
