{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "But the very little we know of Babylonian philosophy would", "span": "lead us to think that it inclined towards pantheism of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "Cf. Aetius, de Placitis Philosophorum , ed. Didot, Bk I.", "span": "c. iii. \u00a7 38 (Plutarch, Moralia , II. ), p.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "Cf. St Augustine, de Natura Boni , c. XLII. But", "span": "Manes doubtless found it necessary to work into his system", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "1052 . En Nad\u00eem in Kessler, op. cit. p. 389;", "span": "Fl\u00fcgel, op. cit. pp. 87, 88. According to the Christian", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "1054 . En Nad\u00eem in Kessler, op. cit. pp. 389,", "span": "390; Fl\u00fcgel, op. cit. p. 87. As Kessler points out,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": ") are eight.\u201d which if it refers to the aspects", "span": "would agree with En Nad\u00eem. Alexander of Lycopolis ( adv.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "See West, Pahlavi Texts ( S.B.E. ), pt iii. p.", "span": "243. Cf. Cumont, Cosmog. Manich. p. 27, n. 2. 1056", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "1058 . Hegemonius, Acta , c. VIII. p. 12, Beeson.", "span": "St Augustine ( contra Faustum , Bk XX. c. 10)", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "That the name \u201cMother of Life\u201d at least passed to", "span": "all these goddesses is certain; but it also found its", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "47, 55), and in the Chinese treatise from Tun-huang (Chavannes", "span": "et Pelliot, op. cit. p. 511 et al. ). In", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "But besides this, she is identified in the G\u00e2th\u00e2s with", "span": "the Wisdom of God (for references see pp. 136-137 of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "1067 . This Living Spirit is the most active agent", "span": "of the Light in the Manichaean system, and seems to", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "26, 28), and also of the \u201ccommands\u201d of the Holy", "span": "Spirit to the Hearers, which are plainly allusions to the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "The Latin version has vir \u201cman\u201d for aer \u201cair\u201d in", "span": "its description of the Column of Glory. Probably a clerical", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "As the \u201carmour\u201d of the First Man, from which the", "span": "souls of men are formed, was made with the aid", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "The Manichaeans really acknowledged, as they were never tired of", "span": "affirming, only two gods, Light and Darkness, and considered all", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "Cumont, Cosmog. Manich. p. 1, n. 2, and authorities there", "span": "quoted. 1118 . \u1f08\u03bd\u03b1\u03b8\u03b5\u03bc\u03b1\u03c4\u03af\u03b6\u03c9 \u03c0\u03ac\u03bd\u03c4\u03b1\u03c2 \u03bf\u1f53\u03c2 \u1f41 \u039c\u03ac\u03bd\u03b7\u03c2 \u1f00\u03bd\u03ad\u03c0\u03bb\u03b1\u03c3\u03b5 \u03b8\u03b5\u03bf\u1f7a\u03c2,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "1126 . The image is probably his body or substance,", "span": "which is of the substance of the Very Great Father.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "1129 . Evidently Manes accepted the dictum of Valentinus quoted", "span": "above ( Chap. IX , p. 104 supra ), that", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "It seems there to mean simply \u201celement.\u201d Cf. Chavannes et", "span": "Pelliot, op. cit. 2 me partie, p. 101. 1135 .", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "Bk XX. c. 2) calls \u201cGod the Son.\u201d 1169 .", "span": "Evidently the incarnate or human messengers, Zoroaster, Buddha, Jesus, and", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "Pistis Sophia | Project Gutenberg *** START OF THE PROJECT", "span": "GUTENBERG EBOOK 76266 *** on Pistis Sophia i PISTIS SOPHIA", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "These writers were avowed heresy-hunters, keenly alive to the danger", "span": "to Christianity in the doctrines which they exposed, and therefore", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "It is this conduct on the part of the Fathers", "span": "that gives us such a distorted and often ridiculous view", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "xxxviii The First Document ... 1 The Second Document ...", "span": "63 The Third Document ... 127 The Fourth Document ...", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "62 , infra , in a different hand and in", "span": "blacker ink than the foregoing part of the MS. The", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "[12] At length in 1887, Lipsius published a detailed study", "span": "of it in Smith and Wace\u2019s Dictionary of Christian Biography", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "He also asserted in his Preface, with much show of", "span": "reason, that it was the statements made by him in", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "But the Pistis Sophia remained untouched by M. Am\u00e9lineau save", "span": "for the excerpts from it to be found in his", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "without attempt at solution. It was in consequence very severely", "span": "criticised first by Dr. Schmidt, and then by Dr. Andersson,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "It is also evident that in his translation from Schwartze\u2019s", "span": "Latin version he has omitted in more than one instance", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "other than Biblical\u2014allows it to be, and that very little", "span": "complaint can be made against it on the score of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "The reasons for doing so xiv will be best given", "span": "when we come to consider the composition and authorship of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "The opening sentence of the fourth implies that it is", "span": "the continuation of a conversation which cannot be certainly identified", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "He then goes on to describe His journey upward through", "span": "the First Sphere directly above the firmament, the Second Sphere", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "These Penitences are twelve in number, and in the course", "span": "of their recital and the conversation that takes place on", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "The Document goes on to elaborate the story of the", "span": "rescue of Pistis Sophia, and tells with great detail how", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "[21] Beginning with the answer to Mary\u2019s question as to", "span": "the nature of the twenty-four Unseen Ones of whom Pistis", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "They repeat the same phrase with the variation of two", "span": "or three words at each repetition, the object being apparently", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "[27] This kind of rhapsody does not seem to be", "span": "cast into any rhythmical form, yet seems to be intended", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "It begins by an exhortation to the disciples to preach", "span": "\u201cto the whole world\u201d a series of \u1f00\u03c0\u03bf\u03c4\u03ac\u03b3\u03bc\u03b1\u03c4\u03b1 or renunciations", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "Among the tormentors in these various hells we find Ariel,", "span": "Pistis Sophia\u2019s persecutor Ialdabaoth, one \u201cIakhthanabas the Merciless\u201d and the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "The Spirit Counterfeit, on the other hand, is the envelope", "span": "or mask of the soul which constantly leads it to", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "The sentence about the journeys of the Apostles written on", "span": "the blank leaf bound in with the rest of the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "This would solve the problem which has so vexed the", "span": "minds of commentators like Prof. Harnack and Dr. Schmidt as", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "Yet it is equally plain that no two of the", "span": "documents are by the same hand. While the First Document", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "Hence it must be considered as the mother document, so", "span": "to speak, from which all the rest are derived, or", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Yet the literary critic, especially he who is acquainted with", "span": "the literature of the early Christian centuries, will hardly require", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "It should also be noticed that in this Document, the", "span": "terrors of hell are hardly touched upon, and the \u201cafflictions\u201d", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "[71] The rebel Rulers of the stars are here made", "span": "for the first time the instruments in the punishment of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "The Third Document, however, resumes the descent of the slope", "span": "of degradation with increased speed. As with the Egyptian funerary", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "The formal remission of sins which precedes this sacrament is", "span": "accomplished by the invocation of many powers with incomprehensible names,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "Yet the writer shows an acquaintance with the Platonic philosophy", "span": "and also with those Synoptic Gospels which were admittedly written", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "Thus, Iren\u00e6us, who wrote at least a generation after Valentinus,", "span": "records the teaching of Valentinus\u2019 immediate successor, Ptolemy; Hippolytus, half", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Yet none of these three last-named Powers produced offspring without", "span": "female assistance, being, according to one account, themselves both male", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "[94] On finding herself alone, however, this Sophia Without, as", "span": "she was called, suffered several \u201cpassions\u201d or emotions:\u2014fear, grief, perplexity,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "[95] xli It may, of course, be thought that by", "span": "putting forth ideas so much opposed to our modern ideas", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "[96] Iren\u00e6us and Tertullian are agreed that certain Valentinians explained", "span": "the names of their Supreme Ogdoad as a mere figure", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "The same discrepancies are marked in the old Egyptian religion", "span": "from which, if I am right, Valentinus drew his phraseology.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "[101] We see, then, that the fundamental points of Valentinus\u2019", "span": "teaching were the manifestation of the Godhead in three successive", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "We find Tertullian in his attack on the Valentinians quoting", "span": "a remark about those who seek God in simplicity of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "32), Tertullian speaks of the flesh of man being created", "span": "ex faecibus terrae \u201cfrom the dregs of the earth,\u201d which", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "So, too, Hippolytus ( Philosophumena , VI. 30, p. 283,", "span": "Cr .), by a sort of slip of the pen,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "Schmidt calls \u201c Unbekanntes altgnostiche Werk ,\u201d plunges into a", "span": "description of the Source of All Being which leaves nothing", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "[105] Such foolishness seems to have been popular in Egypt,", "span": "Catholic writers themselves not being entirely free from it, [106]", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "The author goes so far in one place as to", "span": "quote from the Epistle to the Romans as having been", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "But if it be this episode which is really hinted", "span": "at in our Third Document, this last cannot be put", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "It was probably this which led Lipsius to think that", "span": "he could perceive Manichaean features in our text. To sum", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "And they were thinking that it is the completion of", "span": "all the completions because that Jesus was saying to them", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "And he had not said unto them the Place of", "span": "the three Amens in what Place they are distributed [3", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "Because of this therefore the disciples were thinking that there", "span": "is not anything becoming within that mystery. It happened therefore", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "But they were only seeing the light casting out beams", "span": "of light which are great. And not equal with one", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "From to-day, therefore, henceforth I shall speak with you in", "span": "boldness from the beginning of the Truth even to its", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "For I said to you many times that the power", "span": "which becometh within you, this which I brought out of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "But the power of the little Iao, he of the", "span": "Middle, and the soul of Helias the prophet, they (are)", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "And when your time was finished they produced you in", "span": "[14 b ] the World, there not being soul of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "Rejoice therefore and be glad because ye are happy beyond", "span": "all the men who (are) upon the earth, because ye", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "(The) First indeed being [17 b ] in it all", "span": "the glory of all names of all the mysteries with", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "And I left that Place behind me, I came unto", "span": "the great Aeons of the Rulers, [22 a ] I", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "And they were not able to shut all their Places", "span": "because of the great fear in which they were becoming:", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "It happened therefore, they having warred against the light, they", "span": "all burned one with another and fell down in the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "These therefore having said unto his disciples, said he to", "span": "them, He who hath ear to hear let him hear.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Because of this word therefore, my Lord, which it said", "span": "thus (viz.) the power which (is) in Esaias the prophet,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "It happened, therefore, Maria having finished saying these words, said", "span": "he, Well (done) Maria because thou art happy beyond every", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "It happened therefore, Jesus having finished saying these words, Philippos", "span": "(was) sitting, writing every word which Jesus is saying; [31", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "Now therefore I shall not hide anything from you from", "span": "this hour, but I shall reveal [33 a ] everything", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "And they cast them unto this World of the mankind,", "span": "and they become for soul in that Place according as", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "It happened therefore while the Rulers of the Aeons, with", "span": "those of the Destiny, with those of the Sphere are", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "But their turning, or their looking, I altered it unto", "span": "other 20 array; and I caused them to spend six", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Except therefore that I altered [38 a ] their courses,", "span": "and except that I shortened their times, they would not", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "And they all hymned together unto the inward part of", "span": "the inward parts. And all their Triple powers, with their", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "And again to spend another six months beholding the Right", "span": "in their three-corners and in their four-corners, with those who", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "But she was wont to hymn the light which (is)", "span": "at the Height, this which she saw in the veil", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "But she ceased doing the mystery of the thirteenth Aeon.", "span": "But she was hymning unto the Light of the Height,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "But she continued making lament, seeking for the light which", "span": "she saw: and hated her the Rulers [43 b ]", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "Pursued her the Rulers of the Aeons, and they were", "span": "angry with her, because she thought of greatness. But she", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "And having looked unto the Height, I saw all the", "span": "Rulers of the Aeons which are many. And they are", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "But I, I was looking up unto the Height, up", "span": "unto thee O Light. And I trusted unto thee: now", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "And having sought after the light, they gave to me", "span": "a darkness, and having sought after my power they gave", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "And let them not be reckoned unto those who will", "span": "repent quickly, for them to receive mystery quickly in the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "Now therefore he who hath ear to hear let him", "span": "hear. Came forward again Maria, said she, My Lord, my", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "Because he whom thou smotest they pursued him; they added", "span": "upon the pain of his wounds, they added unlawfulness upon", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "Added also Jesus in the word, said he, Added also", "span": "the Pistis Sophia she hymned in a second Repentance saying", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Because of this therefore, O Light, cease not from me:", "span": "turn thee, O Light, and deliver me from the unmerciful", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "Let me not be ashamed for ever. Save me in", "span": "thy righteousness and deliver me. Incline thy ear unto me", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "Ye are happy (ones) beyond every man who is upon", "span": "the earth, because [56 b ] I revealed unto you", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "Me therefore now, O Light, deliver me, because I diminished", "span": "(in) my light which they took away, and I am", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "Let them [58 b ] be ashamed and disgraced, those", "span": "who seek after my soul. Let them turn them henceforth", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "I forgot my mystery this which I was wont to", "span": "do at first. From the shout of the fear with", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "And then at that time all the Rulers of the", "span": "material Aeons they will fear thy Light, and all the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Answered Iohannes, said he, My Lord, the Saviour, concerning this", "span": "repentance which said the Pistis Sophia, prophesied once concerning it", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "He looked upon the prayer of those who are humble", "span": "and he despised not their supplication. Let them 34 write", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "I shall hymn unto thee in my hymn. I hymned", "span": "unto thee in the Height, and that in which I", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "But I [64 b ] hymned up unto thee, O", "span": "Light and my repentance will attain thee up unto the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "And thou lettest me not come forward, that I may", "span": "say the explanation of the mysteries of the repentance of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "Now therefore, My Lord, hear that I may say it", "span": "boldly. Thou saidst to us, He who hath ear to", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "This therefore is the explanation of the mystery of the", "span": "fifth repentance which said the Pistis Sophia, they having afflicted", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Now therefore he who whose mind is exalted, let him", "span": "understand. It happened therefore, Jesus having finished saying these words", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "Added also Jesus in the word, said he to his", "span": "disciples, It happened, the Pistis Sophia having finished saying the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "Give heed for to deliver me, O Light, because thy", "span": "mercifulness becometh even unto age: because of my transgression which", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "Give heed unto me, O Light, and deliver me. For", "span": "I, they took away my name from me in the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "Bring me out of my necessities. See my humility with", "span": "my tribulations and forgive all my sins. See mine enemies", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "But I through my own self in mercifulness, without [77", "span": "a ] command I brought her unto a Place widened", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "It happened therefore, they having oppressed her, she cried out", "span": "in the same Repentance, saying, Have compassion upon me, O", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Let be shut the mouth of those who wish to", "span": "swallow me (down) in guile, these who say, Let us", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "Came forward Maria, said she, O Lord, because of this", "span": "45 indeed thou saidst unto us once in a parable,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "And, O Light, because of whom I hymn up unto", "span": "thee, Deliver me. I know that thou wilt deliver me,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "They opened their mouth against me, said they, Yea, we", "span": "shall take away her light. Now therefore, O Light, thou", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "Let them clothe them with shame with disgrace, those who", "span": "say great words against me. Let them be glad and", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "She cried also up unto the Light, saying, O Light,", "span": "whom I believed from at first, because of whom I", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "And she knew that I am out of the Height", "span": "of the Heights, this whose light she believed from at", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "The arrows of the strong one are sharp with the", "span": "coals of the desert. Woe to me because my place", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "Because of this therefore the Light will take away all", "span": "their light, and (will) be overthrown all their other matter", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "Thou lovedst all the words of the deceit with a", "span": "tongue of guile. Because of this God will overthrow thee", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": ") feared and it cried up unto its God Self-willed,", "span": "for him to help it: and at that hour looked", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "And let another take his greatness among the three Triple-powered:", "span": "Let become lightless all the powers of his emanations, and", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "But came forward Andreas, said he, My Lord, the Saviour,", "span": "thy power of light prophesied once by David concerning this", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "Let them become in presence of the Lord at every", "span": "time. Let them scatter his remembrance out of the earth.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "But added again Jesus in the word, said he to", "span": "his disciples, It happened also after these (things), cried up", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "I came down unto the Chaos, [100 b ] I", "span": "transgressed before thee, that thy precept should be completed. These", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "And my power of light brought the Pistis Sophia up", "span": "unto the Places which (are) upward of the Chaos. It", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "And they said to take away all my light, and", "span": "they were not able to take it away, because thy", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "My hope (is) being in the Lord, and I shall", "span": "not fear: because thou art my God, [104 a ]", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "But she hymned unto my power of Light which became", "span": "for a crown unto her head: [105 a ] but", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "But answered Maria the mother of Jesus, said she, My", "span": "Lord, thy power of light prophesied about these [106 a", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "And himself that Mystery, dispatched to me a great power", "span": "of Light out of the Height for me to help", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "The truth also is the power which came out of", "span": "thee, because that thou completedst the truth, for thee to", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "This therefore is the word with its explanation. The mercy", "span": "is the spirit which came out of the Height by", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "This is the interpretation of the second \u03b1\u03b1\u03b1\u03b1 \u03b1\u03b1\u03b1\u03b1 \u03b1\u03b1\u03b1\u03b1.", "span": "This is the interpretation of the whole name. 63 THE", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "That matter therefore of the Barbelo, that (is) which becometh", "span": "to thee for body to-day. And the righteousness with the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "It happened therefore when Iohannes had uttered these words, said", "span": "he to him, the First Mystery which looked outward, Well", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "And Gabriel with Mikhael brought the effluence of Light upon", "span": "the body of the matter of the Pistis Sophia, and", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "[119 b ] And again they were exalted in the", "span": "perception of light, and all the powers of light of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "Hear therefore, my Lord and I (shall) utter the word", "span": "in boldness, according as thy power prophesied by Solomon. An", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "And also according as also said thy power, They gave", "span": "to them the drink through him who is exalted, namely,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "And also the word which thy power said, They set", "span": "up limbs which fell, (or that they should not fall),", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "It happened therefore, the First Mystery having heard these words,", "span": "saying them Petros, said he to him, Well (done), O", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "It happened therefore, they having disturbed her, she ran from", "span": "them, she came unto the Places which (are) of the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "I am believing thee, O Light, because thou art my", "span": "deliverer of me from the emanations of the Self-willed and", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "And also by my command, I, the First Mystery who", "span": "looked outward, enlightened greatly greatly my effluence of Light, this", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "And I took away the power from all the emanations", "span": "of the Self-willed: and they fell all in the Chaos", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "This is, O Lord, the explanation of the words which", "span": "thou saidst. Hear therefore that I may say them in", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "And the word which thy 72 power of light prophesied", "span": "by David, The truth will surround thee as armour (a", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "Because of this therefore said thy power, He will not", "span": "fear [134 a ] for a calamity of demon of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "Because of this therefore the Pistis Sophia filled her sight", "span": "with her enemies, namely, the emanations of the Self-willed in", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "That also is the word that thou orderest to Gabriel", "span": "with Mikhael for them to steer the Pistis Sophia through", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "I came (close) to thee, O Light, because thou becamest", "span": "light on every side of me, thou art delivering me", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "This is the Repentance which said the Pistis Sophia, she", "span": "having come up from the Chaos, and having been loosened", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "Thou shelteredst me under the shadow of thy mercy, and", "span": "I became above the coats of the skin. Thy right", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "And the word which thy power said, Thy face was", "span": "becoming with me in thy grace. That is the word", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "And thou coveredst over me with the light of thy", "span": "effluence. And the word which thy power said, I became", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "It happened therefore, the First Mystery having heard Thomas saying", "span": "these words, said he to him, Well (done and) fairly,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "And thou directedst my way to bring me out of", "span": "the Chaos. And thou removedst me out of the material", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "It is he who brought me down from the Places", "span": "which are high above, and he brought me up from", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "That is the word which said the Pistis Sophia, I", "span": "hymn up unto thee, this through whose precept thou broughtest", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "And thou settest me up upon his matter, thou destroyedst", "span": "him that his seed should not rise up from this", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "That is the word which said the Pistis Sophia, And", "span": "thou tookest away all my powers, these in which there", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "It happened therefore, the First Mystery having heard these words,", "span": "saying them Mathaios, said he, Well (done) Mathaios and fairly,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "Now therefore, thou O Maria, utter the explanation of the", "span": "words, these which said the Pistis Sophia. Answered therefore Maria,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "But added also the First Mystery, said he to the", "span": "disciples. Added also in the hymn the Pistis Sophia and", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "He who redeemeth thy life out of the destruction. He", "span": "who giveth a crown of mercy upon thy head and", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "And he brought me up, he put me in an", "span": "Aeon being exalted, and being firm. He put me on", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "It happened therefore, I having brought her unto the Place", "span": "which is below of the [154 b ] thirteenth Aeon.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "But afterwards also said I to her. Hear and I", "span": "(will) speak with thee of their time in which these", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "But thou wilt not have authority to go in unto", "span": "the gate of the Height, this which becometh in the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "But I, I left her in the Place which is", "span": "below the thirteenth Aeon. I went unto the light, I", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "Remembered also the Adamas (about) the Pistis Sophia, and he", "span": "was angry with her greatly greatly, thinking that it (is)", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Came forward Iakkobos said he, My Lord, [161 a ]", "span": "concerning this hymn, in which hymned the Pistis Sophia, thy", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "But he is compassionate until the time which he said", "span": "to me, I am coming and I (will) help thee,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "Now therefore, O Light, the Chaos which he fashioned for", "span": "to cast me unto it, and (to) take away my", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "But these having said them Martha, said he to her", "span": "the First Mystery who looketh outwards, Well (done and) fairly,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "She came up unto the midst of the Invisibles, she", "span": "hymned unto me in their midst, saying, I shall manifest", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "I shall manifest [166 b ] to thee, O Light,", "span": "because thou deliveredst me, and thy wonders happened in the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "They cried up unto the Lord in their being distressed,", "span": "he delivered them out of their necessity: he sent his", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "It happened therefore also after all these (things) came forward", "span": "Mariham, she worshipped at the feet of Jesus, said she,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "Now therefore there is not any in this World being", "span": "of the nature of the heaven, Amen I say to", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "And ye will see all their shape in truth without", "span": "comparison. And whenever I should take you unto the Height,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "And whenever I should take you unto the Place of", "span": "the Middle, ye will see the glory in which they", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "And 94 whenever I should take you unto the Place", "span": "of those who received the Inheritance, of those who received", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "It happened therefore, Maria having heard these words, speaking them", "span": "the Saviour, she rejoiced in great joy greatly and she", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "They said therefore, These will happen in the time of", "span": "the consummation of the catching-up of the Universe. The twelve", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "And the sixth Saviour of the emanations of the sixth", "span": "Voice of the Treasury of the Light will become in", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "And the seven (seventh, MS ) Amens with the five", "span": "(fifth, MS ) Trees with the three [179 a ]", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "Ieou indeed he is the Overseer of the Light who", "span": "came forth first from the pure light of the first", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "And with the fifteen Helpers of the seven Virgins of", "span": "the Light, these who become in the Middle will be", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "And that Mystery indeed is that which [192 b ]", "span": "knoweth because of what the Punishments of the sinners became,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "And that Mystery indeed is that which knoweth because of", "span": "what became the Rulers of the tyrant Aeons, and because", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "And that Mystery indeed is that which knoweth because of", "span": "what became the Phoster (Planets) and because of what became", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "And that Mystery indeed is that which knoweth because of", "span": "what became the Gate of the life, and because of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "But now therefore hear that I may speak with you", "span": "in advance concerning the knowledge of that Mystery: because that", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "And the soul which receiveth this mystery of the Ineffable", "span": "will fly unto the Height becoming a great effluence of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "[213 a ] He is a man being upon the", "span": "World, but he excelleth all the Tyrants, and he will", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "He is a man being upon the World, but he", "span": "will become King with me in my kingdom. He is", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "Likewise also he who will receive the second mystery of", "span": "the First Mystery with the third with the fourth even", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "It happened, Jesus having finished saying these words unto his", "span": "disciples, came forward Maria the Magdalene, said she, My Lord,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "All these having finished saying them the Saviour unto his", "span": "disciples, came forward Andreas, said he, My Lord, Be not", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "Otherwise not any soul in all the race of the", "span": "mankind would be saved. And they would not inherit the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "Because of this therefore, 126 preach to all the race", "span": "of the mankind, Renounce all the World with all its", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "And whenever ye should arrive at the Place of the", "span": "great Invisibles with the Place of those of the Middle,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "And the fires of the Chaos are not wont to", "span": "molest it greatly, but [241 b ] in part they", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "And it is wont to cause her to lust after", "span": "everything of the World, in one word, it is wont", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "And is wont that soul, she is wont to dismiss", "span": "them to their Fate, saying to them, Receive to you", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "She therefore finding it not, is wont the counterfeit spirit,", "span": "it 149 is wont to take that soul (close) to", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "If however it is a new soul they are wont", "span": "to take out of the sweat of the Rulers, and", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "And is wont that cup of forgetfulness, it is wont", "span": "to become counterfeit 170 spirit to that soul. And it", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "And I shall say unto you the name of all", "span": "those who work [304 a ] the soul, and I", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "If indeed she should not say the mysteries of the", "span": "loosening of thy bonds with thy seals with the defence", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "Answered Maria, said she, Then every man who (is) on", "span": "the World, then every work which is reckoned unto them", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "Because of the sinners I despoiled myself at this time,", "span": "I brought the mysteries to them, that I should unloose", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "These are the (things) which ye will say unto the", "span": "men to whom ye preach, that they should keep them(selves)", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "But the rest also I turned them unto righteous bodies,", "span": "these who will find the mysteries of the Light, and", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "But Jesus was standing at the altar, and cried out", "span": "Jesus, turned him(self) about it unto the four corners of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "But the disk of the sun was being a great", "span": "dragon with his tail within his mouth, being mounted on", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "Then therefore Iabraoth believed the mysteries of the Light with", "span": "his Rulers, and he worked in the mysteries of the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "And also he drew another power out of Ipsantakhounkhainkhoukheokh, who", "span": "is one among the three triple-powered gods, he bound it", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "And I shall give to you the mystery of the", "span": "thirteenth (thirteen, MS ) Aeon with the manner of invoking", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "And is wont Ieou also to withdraw him(self) unto the", "span": "Places of those on the Right until the time also", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "And all the souls which (are) in her punishments, they", "span": "are wont to take them away and throw them back", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "Added also said he, The (Ruler of the) third array", "span": "they are wont to call, The hecate the three of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "He added also, said he, The (Ruler of the) fourth", "span": "array which they are wont to call, The Assessor of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "Again also he added in the word, said he to", "span": "his disciples, The fifth array, of which they are wont", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "Said Jesus to his disciples, Draw near unto me. And", "span": "they drew near unto him: he turned unto the four", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "He who knoweth that Name, whenever he should come out", "span": "of the body of the matter, shall not any smoke", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "After these (things) they (will) take her upon the road", "span": "of the Middle, and each of the Rulers of the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "And after these (things) [346 a ] they take her", "span": "down unto Amente (close) to Ariel, and he (is wont)", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "And whenever should the Sphere turn round, she is wont", "span": "to give her to her Receivers, that they may cast", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "And after these (things), they are wont to take her", "span": "to the Virgin of the Light that she may judge", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "And the steam of the flame of the punishments [352", "span": "b ] is wont to become touching her only a", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "Said Mariham, Then a man having done every sin and", "span": "every unlawfulness, having not found the mysteries of the Light", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "120 a , Solomon (Odes), 1-9, Petros, 65 130 a", "span": ", Psalm 90 (91), 1-16, Iakkobos, 70 138 b ,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Counterfeit spirit, 32 , 141 -148, 150 , 151 ,", "span": "169 -175 Course: of the sun, 2 ; of the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": ", 184 Members, 8 , 77 , 79 , 112", "span": ", 114 , 121 , 127 Middle, the, 115 ;", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "13 . I had the pleasure in 1912 of again", "span": "uncovering a great part of these tombs under the leadership", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "16 . E.g. M. Maspero\u2019s review in the Revue Critique", "span": "( n. 3, LXVIII. , 2nd plie) for 1909, pp.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": ", however, it generally signifies the signs of the Zodiac", "span": "and their curious adjunct the thirteenth \u00c6on, which are all", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "36 . See p. 361, Copt. 37 . See pp.", "span": "364-371, Copt. 38 . See pp. 372-376, Copt. 39 .", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "11 (First Document) where Jesus says to His disciples: \u201cWherefore", "span": "I said to you in the Beginning that you are", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Poy. p. 179. 87 . P. 361, Copt. 88 .", "span": "Forerunners , II. , pp. 178-180. 89 . Axionicus was", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": ". . 28 -89 CHAPTER III THE ORIGIN OF GNOSTICISM", "span": "Religion and Magic\u2014Knowledge chief necessity in magic\u2014Origin of myths, cosmogonies,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "Lipsiae, 1832. (Thilo\u2019s Codex Apocryphus Novi Testamenti, t. I .)", "span": "Hal\u00e9vy, Joseph. Recherches Bibliques, Pt 1. Le T\u00e9tragramme. Paris, 1884.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": ", etc. \u00c9tudes de Mythologie et d\u2019Arch\u00e9ologie \u00c9gyptiennes. Paris, 1893,", "span": "etc. In progress. Tt. 7. (Quoted infra as \u201c\u00c9t. \u00c9gyptol.\u201d)", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "1853. 9 vols. (German title: Allgemeine Geschichte der christlichen Religion", "span": "und Kirche. ) Neumann, Carl Friedrich. Marcions Glaubenssystem. 1866. See", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "In progress. (Quoted infra as J.R.A.S. ) Royal Society of", "span": "Literature. Transactions. 2nd series. 1843, etc. In progress. Ruelle, G.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "Bd II . Die Religion bei den iranischen V\u00f6lkern. )", "span": "Turmel, J. L\u2019Ang\u00e9lologie depuis le faux Denys l\u2019Ar\u00e9opagite. Paris, 1898.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "As an instance of this, let us take the notion", "span": "of an archetypal or heavenly man created ages before the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "The lxii Pistis Sophia , although doubtless written in Greek", "span": "in the first instance, comes to us in a Coptic", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "Moreover, the means by which the consequence of any voluntary", "span": "or involuntary transgression of the supposed commands of the gods", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "But that the schools calling themselves Gnostic owed their development", "span": "directly or exclusively to them is an idea that must", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "As for magic, the sevenfold division of things 118 which", "span": "implied that each planet had its own special metal, precious", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "It is certainly by no accident that the emperors whose", "span": "reigns immediately preceded the establishment of Christianity all turned towards", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "It is true that, as M. Cumont has recently pointed", "span": "out, man is never rigidly true to his beliefs, and", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "But the one of these half-Jewish 176 half-Gentile sects of", "span": "which we have the most detailed account is that which", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "This story became later the universal tradition of the Catholic", "span": "Church. All the patristic writers agree that Simon Magus was", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "In the Great Announcement the First Cause of 180 all", "span": "things is declared to be fire, on the strength of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "In these six, 181 Simon imagined that the Boundless Power", "span": "existed potentially, but not actually, that is to say, that", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "This one is Mind in Thought; for they, being one", "span": "when undivided (\u1f00\u03c7\u03ce\u03c1\u03b9\u03c3\u03c4\u03bf\u03c2) from one another, are [yet] found to", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "Hence each of these Powers or, as Simon here calls", "span": "them for the first time, aeons, like the Supreme Being,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "Simon also goes out of his way to affirm that", "span": "his first syzygy or pair, Mind and Thought, are in", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "To a much greater extent than Philo, therefore, Simon uses", "span": "the religious traditions of both Greeks and Hebrews to give", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "Even before the time of Alexander, the Platonic cosmogony had", "span": "made of the stars and planets habitations where the souls", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "In this case it is probable that the six \u201cRoots\u201d", "span": "again changed their generic name, and after having been called", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "Hence man was originally both male and female, or in", "span": "the words of the Great Announcement 189 \u201cnot simple, but", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "Hippolytus says, however, that Simon made up this part of", "span": "the story out of shame as regards his disciples [614]", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "For the blood turns into seed and milk, and that", "span": "power becomes [at once] mother and father of the things", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "No thought of sex, as we understand it, enters into", "span": "their relations, and no progeny follows from their conjugation, the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Thus did the soul of Helen of Troy pass from", "span": "one body into another until in the shape of Helena", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "199 He also says that their sacrifices were offered to", "span": "\u201cthe Father of the Universes\u201d (\u03c4\u1ff6\u03bd \u1f45\u03bb\u03c9\u03bd) through the rulers", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "But if the fragments quoted are, as seems fairly certain,", "span": "the work either of Simon Magus himself or of some", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "XXII. (1900), p. 121, and see Griffith and Thompson, Demotic", "span": "Magical Papyrus of London and Leiden , p. 61 and", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "403 . The same phrase is used in the Orphic", "span": "Hymn XIII. with regard to Kronos, Abel, Orphica , p.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "266, quoting the Dinkard and the Bundahish . The phrase", "span": "is discussed by M. Salomon Reinach in Revue Arch\u00e9ol. 1901,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "571 . Deut. iv. 24. 572 . Hippolytus, op. cit.", "span": "Bk VI. c. 1, \u00a7 9, p. 247, Cruice. 573", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "The likeness between this and Simon\u2019s system has been noticed", "span": "by, among others, Harvey the editor of Irenaeus, in his", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "It is with this being that Simon according to the", "span": "author of the Clementines ( Hom. II. c. 24) identified", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "generally attributed the existence of evil to the escape of", "span": "one of the syzygies from the control of her spouse", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "612 . Irenaeus, Bk I. c. 16, \u00a7 2, p.", "span": "192, Harvey. A similar motive was assigned by the Orphics", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "He was therefore only in the same position as Paul", "span": "and Barnabas in Phrygia when they were hailed by the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "And that which is great will exist in the boundless", "span": "and incorruptible aeon, which will not be born again.\u201d Besides", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "\u201cWhen ye tread under foot the garment of shame, and", "span": "when the two shall be one, and the outside as", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "639 . Epiph. Haer. XXI. c. 4 ( p. 125,", "span": "vol. II. pt I. , Oehler). 640 . See last", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "For this purpose, they imagined certain spiritual beings, more or", "span": "less numerous, the first pair produced by the Supreme Being,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "Paul was known to have affirmed that he had imparted", "span": "to those who were capable of receiving it. It is,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "And that being the case, it appears more rational to", "span": "accept the interpretation furnished by early writers, who are in", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "On the other [pg 261] hand, he undoubtedly countenances (although", "span": "he does not use) the appellation given to her by", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "It is likewise a fact deserving notice, that the first", "span": "instance we have of the worship of images amongst persons", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "[pg 268] Section II. Menander, Saturninus, And Basilides. The succession", "span": "of heresy, unlike that of the Church, had not for", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "It appears likewise that he initiated his followers by baptism", "span": ", which he represented as the true and only resurrection,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "By an unaccountable inconsistency, however, (for having a system to", "span": "make or improve at pleasure, he might as well have", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "Instead of opening the door to unbridled lust, he affected", "span": "an extraordinary repugnance to every thing carnal, declaring marriage and", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "In this division the Jewish nation came to the share", "span": "of the Prince of the Angels; and as he wished", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "This, of course, and their unscrupulousness as to actions of", "span": "any kind whatever, would entirely exempt them from persecution. It", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "He agreed with Simon likewise in teaching the doctrine of", "span": "the transmigration of souls, and adapted it to the support", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "But his followers thought that there was no reason why", "span": "any individual man might not surpass Jesus, and that, in", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "He made Jesus a mere man, but more excellent than", "span": "other men: he affirmed that the Christ had descended upon", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "[pg 282] They likewise took Judas under their patronage, and", "span": "declare that he betrayed Jesus, not from treachery or a", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "those who are imbued with the heavenly light. By this", "span": "means Jaldabaoth will by degrees lose the whole of that", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "He took for his foundation, as it would seem 641", "span": ", the [pg 293] difficulty of explaining the origin of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "Whatever may be thought of the precise year at which", "span": "he came to that city, he remained there fifteen or", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "From these, according to Valentinus, sprung another pair, the Father", "span": "656 and the Truth: the former of whom the fragment", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "The last mentioned tetrad then, knowing themselves to have been", "span": "sent forth to the glory of the unbegotten Father, desired", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "A new state of things, however, arose from the restlessness", "span": "of the last of the \u00c6ons, namely Wisdom; who, under", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "He likewise separated her productions definitely into two species of", "span": "substance, one radically bad, the other capable of being either", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "It is only partially possessed. Those who have it not", "span": "may be saved by faith and good works, those who", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "The winding up of this state of things is to", "span": "take place when all the spiritual seed has become perfect", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "Indeed he reproached the orthodox for not having preserved the", "span": "true meaning: or rather looked down upon them as being", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "This is evidently another, and a less offensive way of", "span": "stating that to the spiritual mind no passion can communicate", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "He is identified with the Clarus of the old translator", "span": "of Iren\u00e6us; 1. because he is commonly reckoned next to", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Of the followers of Ptolemy, Iren\u00e6us mentions the tenets of", "span": "Colorbasus particularly. He does not indeed name him, but Epiphanes", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "This again was, in all probability, effected by some chemical", "span": "agent, deposited in the bottom of the larger cup, and", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "Such a scheme as this was too palatable to human", "span": "nature not to have many followers; and accordingly it found", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "The professed object of this rite was the regeneration of", "span": "those who underwent it, preparatory to their entering into the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "But that it should have taken hold on the minds", "span": "of men to such an extent and at such a", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "Curiosity being thus canonized, it is remarkable that the Gnostic", "span": "system had baits for almost every description of it. It", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "There have been always those who have professed themselves possessors", "span": "of this supernatural knowledge, and of course others who have", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Questions of this kind had engaged the curiosity of minds", "span": "of the higher order ever since civilization began, and no", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "These would see the apparent incongruities between the law and", "span": "the Gospel, especially in the spirit in which each was", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "Here there was just enough of truth to impose upon", "span": "a person brought up to believe the Gospel without really", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "There was at last a body of these formed between", "span": "the Supreme Being and the authors of this world, perfect", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "There was the same mode of rendering null the distinction", "span": "between moral good and evil, by attributing it to opinion,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "Lewdness of the grossest kind was denied to be any", "span": "sin. There were, [pg 331] indeed, some who embraced the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "The Gnostic called himself spiritual, and the Churchman carnal 732", "span": "; he was the elect and perfect, and the orthodox", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Sic Iren\u00e6us, lib. I. cap. xi. n. 3. Epiphanis sententiam", "span": "referens, scribit: \u201cEst quidem ante omnes Proarche, proanenno\u00ebtos, et inenarrabilis,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "Paulo post, Sophian ab Horo mundatam et confirmatam, ac su\u00e6", "span": "restitutam conjugationi cum dixisset Iren\u00e6us, addit: \u03a7\u03c9\u03c1\u03b9\u03c3\u03b8\u03b5\u1f77\u03c3\u03b7\u03c2 \u03b3\u1f70\u03c1 \u03c4\u1fc6\u03c2 \u1f10\u03bd\u03b8\u03c5\u03bc\u1f75\u03c3\u03b5\u03c9\u03c2", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "The Codex Brucianus was brought to England from Upper Egypt,", "span": "by the famous traveller Bruce, in 1769, and bequeathed by", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "We find ourselves in the pure spheres of the highest", "span": "Plrma; we see, step by step, this world, so rich", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "He it is whose limbs make a myriad, myriad Powers,", "span": "and every Power is a being in itself. The Second", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "Now these things are the Ennead, the Ninefold Being, which", "span": "has come forth from the Father without beginning, who alone", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "To the Father Ineffable, Inconceivable, Unthinkable, Unchangeable, all things have", "span": "been made like in their being. They rejoiced and have", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "The Thought of His Greatness has He brought forth from", "span": "non-being that He might make them to be. Incomprehensible is", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "In the Third Paternity is Silence and the Fount which", "span": "twelve Anointed Ones contemplate, beholding themselves therein. In him are", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "Stheus reigns by Him. The Alone-begotten holds in His right", "span": "hand twelve Paternities, the types of the twelve Apostles (14),", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "Upon her head twelve Monads form a crown; each has", "span": "emanated another twelve. Ten Decads encircle her neck, nine Enneads", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "That which was made in Him was Life.\" The Alone-begotten", "span": "is found in the Monad, dwelling in her as in", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "They named Him \"Pantomorphos,\" and Pure, and Unshakable, and all", "span": "the eternities also called him \"All-powered.\" He is the Servant", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "Then shall all the Invisible Eternities receive from Him their", "span": "crown, so that they may cast themselves among the Invisibles,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "in truth] been born from the Indivisible Body or not:", "span": "that is, from Her who is the Universal Mother (22).", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "Glory be to Thee, O Alone-begotten, for ever and ever.\"", "span": "Then together do they all say Amen. For [? Jesus,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "In the middle of these Enneads and of these Monads", "span": "is an immeasurable Deep towards which all the Universe looks,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "The second is called Hope, and it is by her", "span": "that we hope in the Alone-begotten, the Son of God.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "Then Stheus sent the Logos Dmiourgos, having with him a", "span": "multitude of Powers, wearing the crowns on their heads; and", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "Then went forth Pandlos [All-manifest]; she had a crown on", "span": "her head, and she placed it upon them who had", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "She gave him a ninefold Ennead and five tenfold Decads,", "span": "and that he might have power to accomplish the warfare", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "the Man] a crown bearing the names of all those", "span": "of the Universe, whether Infinite or Ineffable, or Uncontainable, or", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "That-which-was it called onian, and that-which-was-not it called Hyle (matter).", "span": "It separated by the Midst that-which-was from that-which-was-not, and placed", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "She gave unto him ten Powers, and nine Enneads, five", "span": "ons, and she gave unto him Light; and that gave", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "These are the names of the Powers who are over", "span": "the Waters of Life: Michar and Micheu; and they baptise", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "Just as Jerusalem was held to be the centre of", "span": "the earth, so was this \"City\" held to be the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": ", there is union with God in the Eternity of", "span": "Eternities as the consummation of all things\" ( cp. note", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "The substance or \"strain\" of this Cross is symbolised here", "span": "by the Ennead or Ninefold Being, the members of which,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "All the great cosmic processes are to be found within", "span": "the soul. (7) A \"name\" was held to be that", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "\"Basket\" in Hastings' Ency. of Rel. and Ethics ). What", "span": "it signifies exactly I am unable to say. Possibly the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "He is the Invisible Sun of Righteousness behind the visible", "span": "flame which measures time. In other words, he is the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "This fact is important for the history of Christian mysticism.", "span": "(14) This seems to imply a doctrine of pre-existence. Perhaps", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "For example, it seems to imply the doctrine of two", "span": "Logoi that Clement of Alexandria was accused of teaching, and", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "So also the Pentecostal outpouring recorded in Acts was the", "span": "outward sign, or sacramental token, of the assumption by the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "It will be observed that the text shows no hostility", "span": "to \"Faith.\" This is an indication of early date. \"Mystery\"", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "The Propatr, who desires to turn the World to God,", "span": "and who is, through the descent of a particular power,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "\"Gnsis\" was not the possession of a body of secret", "span": "Doctrine in the sense of having a number of formal", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "The \"Spiritual,\" the \"Perfect,\" those perfected in Gnsis, that is,", "span": "were those that were actually conscious of participating in a", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "The meaning of XMI is unknown. It has been suggested", "span": "that it is (with EIC \u0398\u0395\u039f\u03a3) a symbol of the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "These things are important for the date of the Greek", "span": "original. The allusions to Pistis-Sophia are probably interpolated; there seems", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "\u201cJohn, to the multitude below, in Jerusalem, I am being", "span": "crucified, [Pg 13] and pierced with spears and reeds, and", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "10. \u201cAnd as it is Wisdom in \u2018harmony,\u2019 there are", "span": "those on the Right and those on the Left\u2014powers, authorities,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "It is always a matter of difficulty for the rigidly", "span": "objective mind to understand the point of view of the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "2. Yet even John the Beloved, in spite of this", "span": "initiation, cannot yet bear the thought that his Master did", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "But seeing that the word batos in Greek had also", "span": "another meaning, the Gnostics, by their method of mystical word-play,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": "The Docetic writer, Hippolytus says, explained the use of the", "span": "term as follows: \u201cMoses called it Batos , because, in", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "For instance, in setting forth the Sophia-mythus, or Wisdom-story, or", "span": "mystery of cosmogenesis, of the Valentinian school, Hippolytus ( op.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "It is by such means that His Body is [Pg", "span": "31] conformed; it is the mystery of the transformation of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": "But this Voice is no voice of man, but one", "span": "\u201ctruly of God\u201d\u2014a Bath-kol or \u201cHeavenly Voice,\u201d as the Rabbis", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": "[Pg 34] The Door is the Door of the Two", "span": "in One, the state of equilibrium of the opposites which", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": "At each piercing or insinuation of the one into the", "span": "other, that which had been two became one, yet there", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "Life is Passion and Light is Understanding. The Logos divides", "span": "Himself to experience and know Himself. [Pg 39] 10. All", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.letter.343cfc", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "letter", "filler": ", i., 440.) [Pg 44] This \u201ccross-beaming\u201d or operation of", "span": "the Cross is the mode of the energizing of the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.practice.16c6d6", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "practice", "filler": "Every mould of thought was to be broken, every imperfect", "span": "conception was to be transcended, if there was to be", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.planet.9963c1", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "planet", "filler": "They have not yet \u201crisen from the Dead,\u201d and consciously", "span": "ascended the Cross of Light and Life. Thus in the", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.element.b8c144", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "element", "filler": ", ii., 221.) The \u201cElect Race\u201d of Valentinus is the", "span": "\u201cSonship\u201d of Basilides that incarnates on earth for the abolition", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.symbol.0d86a0", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "symbol", "filler": ", 564.) To understand, man must pass beyond the stage", "span": "of man, and self-realize himself as \u201ckin to Him\u201d\u2014the Logos.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.concept.8d904e", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "concept", "filler": ", 439.) This is a vision of the Great Person", "span": "and little person, of the Higher Self and lower self.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.coptic_gnostic.text.e00e53", "family_id": "coptic_gnostic", "role": "text", "filler": "Thus in The Acts of Thomas we read: \u201cCome Thou", "span": "who art more ancient far than the five holy Limbs\u2014Mind,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
