{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.text.ca2fb7", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "text", "filler": "At this time this means they must be able to", "span": "speak, read and write English. 5 No expelled, suspended, or", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.letter.58ee60", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "letter", "filler": "Generally, an Oasis is created from an existing Camp, and", "span": "must be estab- lished by at least three initiate members,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.practice.759a65", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "practice", "filler": "Applications for IV\u00b0 should include the results of the written", "span": "portion of the IV\u00b0 examination and the names of at", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.planet.ef6f79", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "planet", "filler": "Minerval (0\u00b0) and I\u00b0 initiations may be conducted on the", "span": "same occasion at all Camps, Oases and Lodges. However, you", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.element.77ad1b", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "element", "filler": "After the initiations have taken place, an Initiation Report must", "span": "be completed and submitted by the local body. The Report", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.symbol.e87deb", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Initiation Reports should never be filled out before the ceremony", "span": "has taken place, but a scribe may be delegated to", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.concept.d429ea", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "concept", "filler": "The legal name of the initiate must appear on the", "span": "certificate, as we do not keep track of magical names", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.text.ca2fb7", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "text", "filler": "The Representative evaluates such applications and, based upon the experience", "span": "of the petitioner and the local needs, makes recommendations to", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.letter.58ee60", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "letter", "filler": "The IV\u00b0 and P.I. initiations may be taken on the", "span": "same occasion. There is no stigma attached to remaining in", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.practice.759a65", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "practice", "filler": "Also, the Master of the Initiating Body should obtain clearance", "span": "from International Headquarters (or the Candidate\u2019s Grand Lodge) prior to", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.planet.ef6f79", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "planet", "filler": "Both parts of the IV\u00b0 examination may be taken any", "span": "time after the candidate has taken the III\u00b0. Outside of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.element.77ad1b", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "element", "filler": "B. Dues Concession If O.T.O. is recognized as a legal", "span": "entity within a given country (all paperwork subject to prior", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.symbol.e87deb", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "symbol", "filler": "projects may be considered. Such project grants shall not include", "span": "regular local operating expenses, but one-of-a-kind needs and improvements. However,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.concept.d429ea", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "concept", "filler": "IV. Dues, Fees and Donations 13 This new indexing only", "span": "applies to payments by individual members for Initia- tion fees,", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.text.ca2fb7", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "text", "filler": "Canadian resident members taking ini- tiation during a visit in", "span": "USA pay the same as though the initiation occurred in", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.letter.58ee60", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "letter", "filler": "We therefore urge treasury operations in these coun- tries to", "span": "maintain their records in the unindexed amounts (the USD 100%", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.practice.759a65", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "practice", "filler": "Please contact the quartermaster or IHQ for sources and designs.", "span": "Above VI\u00b0, the annual degree dues may be reduced to", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.planet.ef6f79", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "planet", "filler": "If in doubt, consult the Treasurer General. The Treasurer General", "span": "has the right to modify or abolish any local dues", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.element.77ad1b", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "element", "filler": "Local body Masters may apply official O.T.O. business phone bills", "span": "toward dues in this fashion if they are not under", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.symbol.e87deb", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "symbol", "filler": "Initiation equipment is a local expense, except for International Headquarters", "span": "permanent operations and some new openings of degrees. Treasurer General", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.concept.d429ea", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "concept", "filler": "International Headquarters does not consider it appropriate to offer magical", "span": "or spiritual services for monetary gain. An official fund raising", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.text.ca2fb7", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "text", "filler": "Miscellaneous Policy Matters 19 2. International Headquarters Approval. All publications", "span": "must be approved in advance by International Headquarters, except for", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.letter.58ee60", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "letter", "filler": "International Headquarters editorial guidelines discourage the addition of commentaries to", "span": "Crowley\u2019s works in translation. Translator\u2019s notes intended to clarify or", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.practice.759a65", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "practice", "filler": "Local advertising of events such as lectures or classes, etc.", "span": "may be done by Local Bodies. It is strongly suggested", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.planet.ef6f79", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "planet", "filler": "G. Drugs Confirmed sales or solicitation for sales of illegal", "span": "substances at a place and time (including time to arrive", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.element.77ad1b", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "element", "filler": "(cid:127) Don\u2019t participate in magical wars. (cid:127) Don\u2019t give credence", "span": "to magical attacks. (cid:127) Don\u2019t intervene in domestic disputes. (cid:127)", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.symbol.e87deb", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "symbol", "filler": "The only exception to this rule, is that the Frater", "span": "Superior\u2019s Representative may suspend or expel a member in a", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.concept.d429ea", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "concept", "filler": "It is better to do an initiation ritual over than", "span": "to disrupt the event on a suspicion of minor error.", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.text.ca2fb7", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "text", "filler": "A certain amount of degree confidentiality may be forfeited by", "span": "those who assume leadership positions; for example, most Minervals know", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.letter.58ee60", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "letter", "filler": "3. Confidential Documents. O.T.O. considers its initiation rituals and the", "span": "offi- cial instructional documents of its degrees, particularly those of", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.practice.759a65", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "practice", "filler": "members without the express permission of International Headquarters. If you", "span": "are unsure whether a document you possess is confidential, write", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
{"pair_id": "corr.theosophy_pd.planet.ef6f79", "family_id": "theosophy_pd", "role": "planet", "filler": "The following are a few examples of what International Headquarters", "span": "con- siders to constitute \u201cactive recruitment\u201d: proselytizing for other initiatory", "atom_id": null, "epistemic": "OBSERVED"}
